es/food-and-related-products-classification-tool\\\"\u003eFood and Related Products Classification Tool\u003c/a\u003e. To learn more about the different categories of food and food products, see the  \u003ca target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"/food-import-export/general-classification-of-food-food-products/classification-of-general-food-food-products\\\"\u003eClassification of General Food \u0026amp; Food Products.\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/body\u003e\u003c/html\u003e\"},\"data-directus\":\"$undefined\",\"suppressHydrationWarning\":true}]}]\n2e:[\"$\",\"h4\",\"4270\",{\"id\":\"where-can-i-find-the-import-requirements-for-meat-meat-products\",\"className\":\"anchor-section-title\",\"data-text\":\"Where can I find the import requirements for Meat \u0026 Meat Products?\"}]\n2f:[\"$\",\"div\",\"4271\",{\"className\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"sfContentBlock sf-Long-text\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"\u003chtml\u003e\u003chead\u003e\u003c/head\u003e\u003cbody\u003e\u003ch2\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003ch2\u003eWhere can I find the import requirements for Meat \u0026amp; Meat Products?\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe import requirements can be found in the  \u003ca target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"/legislation/wholesome-meat-and-fish-act-1999\\\"\u003eWholesome Meat and Fish (Import, Export and Transhipment) Rules\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eYou must comply with the import requirements before you \u003ca target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"/food-import-export/commercial-imports/what-you-need-to-know-for-import-of-food#import-permit\\\"\u003eapply for an import permit\u003c/a\u003e to bring Meat \u0026amp; Meat Products into Singapore.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eNon-compliance can result in penalties under the\u0026nbsp;\u003ca target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"/legislation\\\"\u003eprevailing food safety laws and regulations\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/body\u003e\u003c/html\u003e\"},\"data-directus\":\"$undefined\",\"suppressHydrationWarning\":true}]}]\n30:[\"$\",\"h4\",\"4272\",{\"id\":\"how-do-i-comply-with-the-import-requirements-for-meat-meat-products\",\"className\":\"anchor-section-title\",\"data-text\":\"How do I comply with the import requirements for Meat \u0026 Meat Products?\"}]\n31:[\"$\",\"div\",\"4273\",{\"className\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"sfContentBlock sf-Long-text\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"\u003chtml\u003e\u003chead\u003e\u003c/head\u003e\u003cbody\u003e\u003ch2\u003eHow do I comply with the import requirements for Meat \u0026amp; Meat Products?\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/body\u003e\u003c/html\u003e\"},\"data-directus\":\"$undefined\",\"suppressHydrationWarning\":true}]}]\n4a:T6d4,\u003chtml\u003e\u003chead\u003e\u003c/head\u003e\u003cbody\u003e\u003cp\u003eMeat and meat products must only be imported from \u003ca target=\"_blank\" href=\"/api/assets/fad4b1a6-6a31-4526-953a-22d81b46135a\" aria-label=\"List of approved countries regions_14 JULY 2026\"\u003eSFA-approved sources\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"callout-type\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"tip-notification\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://assets.app.optical.gov.sg/sfa/production/published/collections/pages/%252Ffood-import-export%252Fcommercial-imports%252Fimport-requirements-for-food-food-products/18ebc740-fefb-4062-b132-b8c48257dc52.svg\" alt=\"Icon Tip\" title=\"Icon Success Notification\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"notification-content\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003eSFA-approved sources and SFA-accredited overseas establishments change from time to time. Always use the \u003ca target=\"_blank\" href=\"/tools-and-resources/accreditation-database-for-overseas-sources\" sfref=\"[f669d9a7-009d-4d83-ddaa-000000000002]798ce0f3-cef4-4d58-bacc-9b4dd20e43a0\"\u003eAccreditation Database for Overseas Sources\u003c/a\u003e to check the approved sources and establishments before you import any consignment.\u0026nbsp;If your establishment\n                    is not listed in the database, please refer to\u0026nbsp;\u003ca target=\"_blank\" href=\"/accreditation-of-overseas-farms-establishments/overseas-accreditation-of-food-food-products#meat--meat-products-0\"\u003eOverseas Accreditation of Food \u0026amp; Food Products - Meat \u0026amp; Meat Products\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eIn addition, always check the latest \u003ca target=\"_blank\" href=\"/news-publications/circulars-and-notices\" sfref=\"[f669d9a7-009d-4d83-ddaa-000000000002|lng%3Aen]66044359-66fd-4479-902d-0232168c8d88\"\u003ecirculars\u003c/a\u003e before you import any consignment. SFA will issue a circular if there are changes to the approved sources (e.g. removed, added or suspended).\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/body\u003e\u003c/html\u003e4b:T520,\u003cp\u003eEach import consignment must be accompanied by a health certificate issued by the \u003cstrong\u003eCompetent Authority of the exporting country or region\u003c/strong\u003e. This certifies that your imports comply with Singapore's animal health and food safety requirements.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"line-height: 120%;\"\u003eObtain the relevant health certificates of the meat and meat products you intend to import from your supplier or exporter.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor information on the retrieval of electronic sanitary certificate (eSPS) for Australia and New Zealand, see \u003ca href=\"#meat-and-meat-products-0#eSPSCertificate\"\u003eeSPS Certificate\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"callout-type\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"tip-notification\"\u003e\u003cimg title=\"Icon Success Notification\" src=\"https://assets.app.optical.gov.sg/sfa/production/published/collections/pages/%252Ffood-import-export%252Fcommercial-imports%252Fimport-requirements-for-food-food-products/18ebc740-fefb-4062-b132-b8c48257dc52.svg\" alt=\"Icon Tip\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"notification-content\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSubmit the health certificate for each consignment in the format agreed by SFA and the overseas authorities. You can \u003ca href=\"https://csp.sfa.gov.sg/feedback\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003econtact SFA\u003c/a\u003e or the overseas authority to check if the health certificate for your imports is in the agreed format.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e4c:T66e,\u003chtml\u003e\u003chead\u003e\u003c/head\u003e\u003cbody\u003e\u003cp\u003eEvery carton and basic packaging unit of your imported meat or meat product \u003cstrong\u003emust\u003c/strong\u003e be labelled with the following:\u2028\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003edescription of the meat product\u2028\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003ecountry/region of origin of the meat product\u2028\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003ebrand name of the meat product (if any)\u2028\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003ename and designation number of the processing establishment (if applicable)\u2028\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003edate that the meat product was processed. The labels of all\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eprocessed meat products\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003emust include the name and designation number of the slaughterhouse that had supplied the meat used in the meat product, and the date of the slaughter.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003ename and designation number of the establishment that packed the meat product and the date of packing\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003ebatch number, location and canning code of the canned meat product\u2028\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003enet weight of the meat product in each basic packaging and outer carton\u2028\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"callout-type\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"tip-notification\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://assets.app.optical.gov.sg/sfa/production/published/collections/pages/%252Ffood-import-export%252Fcommercial-imports%252Fimport-requirements-for-food-food-products/18ebc740-fefb-4062-b132-b8c48257dc52.svg\" alt=\"Icon Tip\" title=\"Icon Success Notification\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"notification-content\"\u003e\u003cp\u003eYou must inform your supplier or exporter to comply with the SFA's labelling requirements.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eFor more details, see \u003ca target=\"_blank\" href=\"/regulatory-standards-frameworks-guidelines/food-labelling-packaging-guidelines/labelling-requirements-for-food\"\u003eLabelling Requirements for Food\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/body\u003e\u003c/html\u003e32:[\"$\",\"$L49\",\"4274\",{\"data\":{\"id\":1355,\"sort\":null,\"user_created\":\"211f17e7-d30c-4260-909a-156da2993df4\",\"date_created\":\"2026-10-11T18:01:45.271Z\",\"user_updated\":\"211f17e7-d30c-4260-909a-156da2993df4\",\"date_updated\":\"2026-10-22T08:38:09.438Z\",\"title\":null,\"accordion_item\":[],\"accordion_items\":[{\"id\":3561,\"Sfacorp_AccordionLayout_id\":1355,\"sort\":1,\"Sfacorp_AccordionItem_id\":{\"id\":3594,\"status\":\"published\",\"sort\":null,\"user_created\":\"211f17e7-d30c-4260-909a-156da2993df4\",\"date_created\":\"2026-10-11T18:01:45.274Z\",\"user_updated\":null,\"date_updated\":null,\"title\":\"Step 1: Import only from approved sources\",\"duration_of_application\":\"\",\"accordion_content\":\"$4a\"}},{\"id\":3562,\"Sfacorp_AccordionLayout_id\":1355,\"sort\":2,\"Sfacorp_AccordionItem_id\":{\"id\":3595,\"status\":\"published\",\"sort\":null,\"user_created\":\"211f17e7-d30c-4260-909a-156da2993df4\",\"date_created\":\"2026-10-11T18:01:45.280Z\",\"user_updated\":\"211f17e7-d30c-4260-909a-156da2993df4\",\"date_updated\":\"2026-10-22T08:38:09.447Z\",\"title\":\"Step 2: Obtain the required health certificates from your supplier\",\"duration_of_application\":\"\",\"accordion_content\":\"$4b\"}},{\"id\":3563,\"Sfacorp_AccordionLayout_id\":1355,\"sort\":3,\"Sfacorp_AccordionItem_id\":{\"id\":3596,\"status\":\"published\",\"sort\":null,\"user_created\":\"211f17e7-d30c-4260-909a-156da2993df4\",\"date_created\":\"2026-10-11T18:01:45.286Z\",\"user_updated\":null,\"date_updated\":null,\"title\":\"Step 3: Ensure food labels are accurate and complete\",\"duration_of_application\":\"\",\"accordion_content\":\"$4c\"}}],\"accordion_sub_header\":{\"id\":1355,\"sort\":null,\"user_created\":\"211f17e7-d30c-4260-909a-156da2993df4\",\"date_created\":\"2026-10-11T18:01:45.270Z\",\"user_updated\":null,\"date_updated\":null,\"sub_header\":\"\",\"template_name\":\"Detail.AccordionSubHeader\"}},\"blockId\":\"4274\",\"itemId\":1355,\"pageId\":\"$undefined\",\"detailData\":\"$undefined\",\"lastUpdated\":\"$undefined\",\"pageTitle\":\"$undefined\",\"current_permalink\":\"$undefined\"}]\n33:[\"$\",\"h4\",\"4275\",{\"id\":\"esps-certificate\",\"className\":\"anchor-section-title\",\"data-text\":\"eSPS Certificate\"}]\n34:[\"$\",\"div\",\"4276\",{\"className\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"sfContentBlock sf-Long-text\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"\u003chtml\u003e\u003chead\u003e\u003c/head\u003e\u003cbody\u003e\u003ch2 id=\\\"eSPSCertificate\\\"\u003eeSPS Certificate\u003c/h2\u003e\u003c/body\u003e\u003c/html\u003e\"},\"data-directus\":\"$undefined\",\"suppressHydrationWarning\":true}]}]\n35:[\"$\",\"$L49\",\"4277\",{\"data\":{\"id\":1356,\"sort\":null,\"user_created\":\"211f17e7-d30c-4260-909a-156da2993df4\",\"date_created\":\"2026-10-11T18:01:45.312Z\",\"user_updated\":null,\"date_updated\":null,\"title\":null,\"accordion_item\":[],\"accordion_items\":[{\"id\":3564,\"Sfacorp_AccordionLayout_id\":1356,\"sort\":1,\"Sfacorp_AccordionItem_id\":{\"id\":3597,\"status\":\"published\",\"sort\":null,\"user_created\":\"211f17e7-d30c-4260-909a-156da2993df4\",\"date_created\":\"2026-10-11T18:01:45.313Z\",\"user_updated\":null,\"date_updated\":null,\"title\":\"What is an eSPS Certificate?\",\"duration_of_application\":\"\",\"accordion_content\":\"\u003chtml\u003e\u003chead\u003e\u003c/head\u003e\u003cbody\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"text-align:justify;line-height:120%;\\\"\u003eAn eSPS certificate is an electronic sanitary certificate (also commonly referred to as a health certificate or veterinary certificate) used for the import/export of animal and animal-related products. An eSPS facilitates the exchange of certificate data with overseas Competent Authorities through Singapore Customs’ eServices. The eSPS certificate has the same validity as paper certificates issued by the overseas Competent Authorities.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/body\u003e\u003c/html\u003e\"}},{\"id\":3565,\"Sfacorp_AccordionLayout_id\":1356,\"sort\":2,\"Sfacorp_AccordionItem_id\":{\"id\":3598,\"status\":\"published\",\"sort\":null,\"user_created\":\"211f17e7-d30c-4260-909a-156da2993df4\",\"date_created\":\"2026-10-11T18:01:45.319Z\",\"user_updated\":null,\"date_updated\":null,\"title\":\"Why use an eSPS Certificate?\",\"duration_of_application\":\"\",\"accordion_content\":\"\u003chtml\u003e\u003chead\u003e\u003c/head\u003e\u003cbody\u003eThe eSPS certificate is an electronic exchange of information between Competent Authorities that is fast and secure, and mitigates risks of fraudulent or missing information. It also saves time as traders do not have to wait for hardcopy sanitary certificates before seeking clearances for the import/export of animal and animal-related products. Traders can also easily retrieve and trace their eSPS certificates from Singapore Customs’ eServices.\u003c/body\u003e\u003c/html\u003e\"}},{\"id\":3566,\"Sfacorp_AccordionLayout_id\":1356,\"sort\":3,\"Sfacorp_AccordionItem_id\":{\"id\":3599,\"status\":\"published\",\"sort\":null,\"user_created\":\"211f17e7-d30c-4260-909a-156da2993df4\",\"date_created\":\"2026-10-11T18:01:45.324Z\",\"user_updated\":null,\"date_updated\":null,\"title\":\"eSPS exchange with Australia and New Zealand\",\"duration_of_application\":\"\",\"accordion_content\":\"\u003chtml\u003e\u003chead\u003e\u003c/head\u003e\u003cbody\u003eThe eSPS certificate exchange with Australia started on 28 June 2023, while the exchange with New Zealand started on 12 May 2023 for the import of meat and meat products.\u003c/body\u003e\u003c/html\u003e\"}},{\"id\":3567,\"Sfacorp_AccordionLayout_id\":1356,\"sort\":4,\"Sfacorp_AccordionItem_id\":{\"id\":3600,\"status\":\"published\",\"sort\":null,\"user_created\":\"211f17e7-d30c-4260-909a-156da2993df4\",\"date_created\":\"2026-10-11T18:01:45.329Z\",\"user_updated\":null,\"date_updated\":null,\"title\":\"Retrieving eSPS Certificates\",\"duration_of_application\":\"\",\"accordion_content\":\"\u003chtml\u003e\u003chead\u003e\u003c/head\u003e\u003cbody\u003eImporters and their authorised declaring agents must first have their own Corppass account that is assigned with digital service \\\"Customs eServices\\\", which can be done at \u003ca href=\\\"https://www.corppass.gov.sg/\\\"\u003ehttps://www.corppass.gov.sg/\u003c/a\u003e, before accessing eSPS enquiry service. Details can be found \u003ca href=\\\"https://www.customs.gov.sg/doing-business/quick-links-for-traders/\\\"\u003eQuick Links for Traders | Singapore Customs\u003c/a\u003e. Importers and their authorised declaring agents can retrieve and trace their eSPS via www.customs.gov.sg \u0026gt; eServices \u0026gt; Search for “Electronic Sanitary and Phytosanitary (e-SPS) Enquiry Service” or via the URL \u003ca href=\\\"https://go.gov.sg/espsenquiry\\\"\u003ego.gov.sg/espsenquiry\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/body\u003e\u003c/html\u003e\"}},{\"id\":3568,\"Sfacorp_AccordionLayout_id\":1356,\"sort\":5,\"Sfacorp_AccordionItem_id\":{\"id\":3601,\"status\":\"published\",\"sort\":null,\"user_created\":\"211f17e7-d30c-4260-909a-156da2993df4\",\"date_created\":\"2026-10-11T18:01:45.338Z\",\"user_updated\":null,\"date_updated\":null,\"title\":\"Making eSPS enquiries\",\"duration_of_application\":\"\",\"accordion_content\":\"\u003chtml\u003e\u003chead\u003e\u003c/head\u003e\u003cbody\u003ePlease refer to the \u003ca href=\\\"/api/assets/5edc442d-f55e-46ab-bd65-dca0ba89edce\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" aria-label=\\\"eSPS Enquiry Guide\\\"\u003eeSPS Certificate Guide\u003c/a\u003e for steps on making and retrieving eSPS certificates.\u003c/body\u003e\u003c/html\u003e\"}}],\"accordion_sub_header\":{\"id\":1356,\"sort\":null,\"user_created\":\"211f17e7-d30c-4260-909a-156da2993df4\",\"date_created\":\"2026-10-11T18:01:45.311Z\",\"user_updated\":null,\"date_updated\":null,\"sub_header\":\"\",\"template_name\":\"Detail.AccordionSubHeader\"}},\"blockId\":\"4277\",\"itemId\":1356,\"pageId\":\"$undefined\",\"detailData\":\"$undefined\",\"lastUpdated\":\"$undefined\",\"pageTitle\":\"$undefined\",\"current_permalink\":\"$undefined\"}]\n36:[\"$\",\"h4\",\"4278\",{\"id\":\"how-do-these-import-requirements-ensure-the-food-safety-of-meat-and-meat-products\",\"className\":\"anchor-section-title\",\"data-text\":\"How do these import requirements ensure the food safety of Meat and Meat Products?\"}]\n37:[\"$\",\"div\",\"4279\",{\"className\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"sfContentBlock sf-Long-text\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"\u003chtml\u003e\u003chead\u003e\u003c/head\u003e\u003cbody\u003e\u003ch2\u003eHow do these import requirements ensure the food safety of Meat and Meat Products?\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eSFA adopts a science and risk-based approach to ensure that food is safe for consumption in Singapore. The requirements imposed ensures food safety and reduce the risk of foodborne illnesses.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAs meat has a higher risk of being contaminated with pathogens compared to processed food or vegetables, SFA requires all meat to be imported only from approved sources or accredited establishments. SFA also requires every consignment to be accompanied by a veterinary health certificate to ensure that your imports comply with Singapore's animal health and food safety requirements.\\n\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdiv\u003eThe labelling requirements also provide consumers with the information to make informed choices. It also improves traceability in the event of food safety issues or recalls.\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/body\u003e\u003c/html\u003e\"},\"data-directus\":\"$undefined\",\"suppressHydrationWarning\":true}]}]\n4d:T732,\u003chtml\u003e\u003chead\u003e\u003c/head\u003e\u003cbody\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eShell eggs:\u003c/strong\u003e Shell eggs may only be imported from approved sources, and each consignment must be derived from a single farm.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEgg products / processed eggs: \u003c/strong\u003eProcessed eggs may only be imported from \u003ca target=\"_blank\" href=\"/api/assets/fad4b1a6-6a31-4526-953a-22d81b46135a\" aria-label=\"List of approved countries regions_14 JULY 2026\"\u003eSFA-approved sources\u003c/a\u003e. \u003c/p\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"callout-type\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"tip-notification\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://assets.app.optical.gov.sg/sfa/production/published/collections/pages/%252Ffood-import-export%252Fcommercial-imports%252Fimport-requirements-for-food-food-products/18ebc740-fefb-4062-b132-b8c48257dc52.svg\" alt=\"Icon Tip\" title=\"Icon Success Notification\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"notification-content\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003eSFA-approved sources and SFA-accredited overseas establishments change from time to time. Always use the\u0026nbsp;\u003ca target=\"_blank\" href=\"/tools-and-resources/accreditation-database-for-overseas-sources\"\u003eAccreditation Database for Overseas Sources\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;to\n check the approved sources and establishments each time you import a consignment. If your establishment is not listed in the database, please refer to \u003ca target=\"_blank\" href=\"/food-import-export/accreditation-of-overseas-farms-establishments/overseas-accreditation-of-specific-food-food-products#shell-eggs-2\"\u003eOverseas Accreditation of Food \u0026amp; Food Products - Shell Eggs / Processed Eggs\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eIn addition, always check the latest\u0026nbsp;\u003ca target=\"_blank\" href=\"/news-publications/circulars-and-notices\" sfref=\"[f669d9a7-009d-4d83-ddaa-000000000002|lng%3Aen]66044359-66fd-4479-902d-0232168c8d88\"\u003ecirculars\u003c/a\u003e before you import. SFA will issued a circular when approved sources are changed (e.g. removed, added or suspended). \u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/body\u003e\u003c/html\u003e4e:T51a,\u003cp\u003eIf your products meet SFA\u0026rsquo;s veterinary conditions, please obtain the required health certificates from your supplier.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEach import consignment must be accompanied by a health certificate issued by the \u003cstrong\u003eCompetent Authority of the exporting country or region\u003c/strong\u003e. This certifies that your imports comply with Singapore's animal health and food safety requirements.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor information on the retrieval of electronic sanitary certificate (eSPS) for the import or export of meat and meat products to or from Australia, see \u003ca id=\"espscertificate\" href=\"#\"\u003eeSPS Certificate\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"callout-type\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"tip-notification\"\u003e\u003cimg title=\"Icon Success Notification\" src=\"https://assets.app.optical.gov.sg/sfa/production/published/collections/pages/%252Ffood-import-export%252Fcommercial-imports%252Fimport-requirements-for-food-food-products/18ebc740-fefb-4062-b132-b8c48257dc52.svg\" alt=\"Icon Tip\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"notification-content\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSubmit the health certificate for each consignment in the format agreed by SFA and the overseas authorities. You can \u003ca href=\"/feedback\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003econtact SFA\u003c/a\u003e or the overseas authority to check if the health certificate for your imports is in the agreed format.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e4f:T449,\u003chtml\u003e\u003chead\u003e\u003c/head\u003e\u003cbody\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eShell eggs and pasteurised shell eggs\u003c/strong\u003e: Please ensure that the labelling requirements for shell eggs and pasteurised shell eggs are compliant with the veterinary conditions.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003ePlease refer to the following for SFA’s veterinary\nconditions:\n\u003cbr\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" href=\"/api/assets/43c0f5bc-8daa-4a6e-844f-792714231aeb\" aria-label=\"Veterinary Conditions for Importation of Shell Eggs\"\u003eVeterinary conditions for the importation of shell eggs\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" href=\"/api/assets/689cf458-f5cf-4dbb-8b5b-9b0726b73500\" aria-label=\"Veterinary Conditions for the Importation of Pasteurised Shell Eggs\"\u003eVeterinary conditions for the importation of pasteurised shell eggs\u003c/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eProcessed eggs:\u003c/strong\u003e Your supplier must comply with the labelling requirements for processed eggs. For more information, please see\u0026nbsp;\u003ca target=\"_blank\" href=\"/regulatory-standards-frameworks-guidelines/food-labelling-packaging-guidelines/labelling-requirements-for-food\"\u003eLabelling Requirements for Food\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/body\u003e\u003c/html\u003e38:[\"$\",\"div\",\"745\",{\"className\":\"sf_colsIn row tab-pane\",\"role\":\"tabpanel\",\"data-placeholder-label\":\"Tab Items\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h4\",\"4280\",{\"className\":\"tab-section-title\",\"data-text\":\"Eggs and Egg Products\",\"children\":\"Eggs and Egg Products\"}],[\"$\",\"$L2c\",\"4281\",{\"data\":{\"id\":1242,\"date_created\":\"2026-10-11T18:01:45.374Z\",\"user_updated\":null,\"date_updated\":null,\"title\":\"Content Overview\"},\"blockId\":\"4281\",\"itemId\":1242,\"pageId\":\"$undefined\",\"detailData\":\"$undefined\",\"lastUpdated\":\"$undefined\",\"pageTitle\":\"$undefined\",\"current_permalink\":\"$undefined\"}],[\"$\",\"h4\",\"4282\",{\"id\":\"what-food-or-food-products-must-meet-the-import-requirements-for-eggs-egg-products\",\"className\":\"anchor-section-title\",\"data-text\":\"What food or food products must meet the import requirements for Eggs \u0026 Egg Products?\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"4283\",{\"className\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"sfContentBlock sf-Long-text\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"\u003chtml\u003e\u003chead\u003e\u003c/head\u003e\u003cbody\u003e\u003ch2\u003eWhat food or food products must meet the import requirements for Eggs \u0026amp; Egg Products?\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eFood or food products classified as ‘Eggs \u0026amp; Egg Products’ such as shell eggs, salted eggs, liquid eggs, and omelettes must meet the import requirements imposed on this category of food or food products.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eTo check if your food or food product falls under ‘Eggs \u0026amp; Egg Products’, use the  \u003ca target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"/tools-and-resources/food-and-related-products-classification-tool\\\"\u003eFood and Related Products Classification Tool\u003c/a\u003e. To learn more about the different categories of food and food products, see the \u003ca target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"/food-import-export/general-classification-of-food-food-products/classification-of-general-food-food-products\\\"\u003eClassification of General Food \u0026amp; Food Products\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/body\u003e\u003c/html\u003e\"},\"data-directus\":\"$undefined\",\"suppressHydrationWarning\":true}]}],[\"$\",\"h4\",\"4284\",{\"id\":\"when-should-i-comply-with-these-requirements-for-eggs-egg-products\",\"className\":\"anchor-section-title\",\"data-text\":\"When should I comply with these requirements for Eggs \u0026 Egg Products?\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"4285\",{\"className\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"sfContentBlock sf-Long-text\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"\u003chtml\u003e\u003chead\u003e\u003c/head\u003e\u003cbody\u003e\u003ch2\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003ch2\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003ch2\u003eWhen should I comply with these requirements for Eggs \u0026amp; Egg Products?\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eYou must comply with these requirements before you \u003ca target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"/food-import-export/commercial-imports/what-you-need-to-know-for-import-of-food#import-permit\\\"\u003eapply for an import permit\u003c/a\u003e to bring Eggs \u0026amp; Egg Products into Singapore.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eNon-compliance can result in penalties under the  \u003ca target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"/legislation\\\"\u003eprevailing food safety laws and regulations\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/body\u003e\u003c/html\u003e\"},\"data-directus\":\"$undefined\",\"suppressHydrationWarning\":true}]}],[\"$\",\"h4\",\"4286\",{\"id\":\"how-do-i-comply-with-the-import-requirements-for-eggs-egg-products\",\"className\":\"anchor-section-title\",\"data-text\":\"How do I comply with the import requirements for Eggs \u0026 Egg Products?\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"4287\",{\"className\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"sfContentBlock sf-Long-text\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"\u003chtml\u003e\u003chead\u003e\u003c/head\u003e\u003cbody\u003e\u003ch2\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003ch2\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003ch2\u003eHow do I comply with the import requirements for Eggs \u0026amp; Egg Products?\u003c/h2\u003e\u003c/body\u003e\u003c/html\u003e\"},\"data-directus\":\"$undefined\",\"suppressHydrationWarning\":true}]}],[\"$\",\"$L49\",\"4288\",{\"data\":{\"id\":1357,\"sort\":null,\"user_created\":\"211f17e7-d30c-4260-909a-156da2993df4\",\"date_created\":\"2026-10-11T18:01:45.414Z\",\"user_updated\":\"211f17e7-d30c-4260-909a-156da2993df4\",\"date_updated\":\"2026-11-12T04:44:36.649Z\",\"title\":null,\"accordion_item\":[],\"accordion_items\":[{\"id\":3569,\"Sfacorp_AccordionLayout_id\":1357,\"sort\":1,\"Sfacorp_AccordionItem_id\":{\"id\":3602,\"status\":\"published\",\"sort\":null,\"user_created\":\"211f17e7-d30c-4260-909a-156da2993df4\",\"date_created\":\"2026-10-11T18:01:45.416Z\",\"user_updated\":null,\"date_updated\":null,\"title\":\"Step 1: Import only from approved sources\",\"duration_of_application\":\"\",\"accordion_content\":\"$4d\"}},{\"id\":3570,\"Sfacorp_AccordionLayout_id\":1357,\"sort\":2,\"Sfacorp_AccordionItem_id\":{\"id\":3603,\"status\":\"published\",\"sort\":null,\"user_created\":\"211f17e7-d30c-4260-909a-156da2993df4\",\"date_created\":\"2026-10-11T18:01:45.420Z\",\"user_updated\":\"211f17e7-d30c-4260-909a-156da2993df4\",\"date_updated\":\"2026-11-12T04:44:36.652Z\",\"title\":\"Step 2: Obtain the required health certificates from your supplier\",\"duration_of_application\":\"\",\"accordion_content\":\"$4e\"}},{\"id\":3571,\"Sfacorp_AccordionLayout_id\":1357,\"sort\":3,\"Sfacorp_AccordionItem_id\":{\"id\":3604,\"status\":\"published\",\"sort\":null,\"user_created\":\"211f17e7-d30c-4260-909a-156da2993df4\",\"date_created\":\"2026-10-11T18:01:45.424Z\",\"user_updated\":null,\"date_updated\":null,\"title\":\"Step 3: Ensure food labels are accurate and complete\",\"duration_of_application\":\"\",\"accordion_content\":\"$4f\"}}],\"accordion_sub_header\":{\"id\":1357,\"sort\":null,\"user_created\":\"211f17e7-d30c-4260-909a-156da2993df4\",\"date_created\":\"2026-10-11T18:01:45.413Z\",\"user_updated\":null,\"date_updated\":null,\"sub_header\":\"\",\"template_name\":\"Detail.AccordionSubHeader\"}},\"blockId\":\"4288\",\"itemId\":1357,\"pageId\":\"$undefined\",\"detailData\":\"$undefined\",\"lastUpdated\":\"$undefined\",\"pageTitle\":\"$undefined\",\"current_permalink\":\"$undefined\"}],\"$L50\",\"$L51\"]}]\n52:T1767,\u003cdiv class=\"callout-type\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"warning-notification\"\u003e\u003cimg title=\"Icon Warning Notification\" src=\"https://assets.app.optical.gov.sg/sfa/production/published/collections/pages/%252Ffood-import-export%252Fcommercial-imports%252Fimport-requirements-for-food-food-products/388ccfa1-c125-4c20-a3af-857ec96c813f.svg\" alt=\"Icon Warning\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"notification-content\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThere are import requirements imposed for Fish \u0026amp; Fish Products that are considered 'high-risk'.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eUse the table below to determine if your food or food products are classified as \u0026lsquo;high-risk\u0026rsquo;. The table also shows the import requirements corresponding to each high-risk item.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"table-text sf_colsIn\" data-sf-element=\"Text Table - Content Block\" data-placeholder-label=\"Text Table - Content Block\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"sfContentBlock sf-Long-text\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"table-wrap\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"table-wrap-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"table-wrap\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"table-wrap-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\"\u003e\n\u003ctable style=\"height: 74.5px; width: 516px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 30.1887%;\"\u003e\n\u003cth style=\"width: 43.5825%;\" data-role=\"resizable\"\u003eHigh-Risk Product\u003c/th\u003e\n\u003cth style=\"width: 56.4174%;\"\u003eRequirements\u003c/th\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 35.2201%;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 43.5825%;\"\u003eChilled-shucked raw oysters\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eChilled cockle meat\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eChilled cooked prawn/shrimp\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eChilled crab meat\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 56.4174%;\"\u003eImport is \u003cstrong\u003enot\u003c/strong\u003e allowed\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 35.2201%;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 43.5825%;\"\u003eLive cockles\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 56.4174%;\"\u003eOnly \u003ca href=\"/api/assets/ea206f61-2dba-4044-b38c-9204241f90cf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"List of Approved Cockle Processing Establishments that can import Live Cockles\"\u003efood processing establishments that are licensed by SFA to shuck cockles\u003c/a\u003e are allowed to import live cockles.\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 35.2201%;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 43.5825%;\"\u003eLive oysters\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 56.4174%;\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eImport of live oysters is only allowed from the following countries or regions which meet SFA\u0026rsquo;s requirements for a shellfish sanitation programme:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAustralia\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCanada\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFrance\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIreland\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eJapan (Fukuoka, Hiroshima, Hokkaido, Mie, Miyagi, Oita,\u0026nbsp;Tokushima, Iwate, and Shimane Prefectures)\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eThe Netherlands\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNew Zealand\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUnited Kingdom\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUSA\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEach import consignment must be accompanied by a health certificate issued by the relevant authority of the exporting country or region.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 35.2201%;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 43.5825%;\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFrozen oysters\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eFrozen blood cockle meat\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eFrozen cooked prawns\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFrozen raw/cooked crab meat\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 56.4174%;\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEach import consignment must be accompanied by a \u003cstrong\u003ehealth certificate\u003c/strong\u003e issued by the relevant authority of the exporting country or region.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor \u003cstrong\u003efrozen oysters\u003c/strong\u003e, the health certificate must certify and state that the consignment has been tested and found to be \u0026lsquo;\u003cstrong\u003efree of norovirus\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026rsquo;.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 35.2201%;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 43.5825%;\"\u003eFrozen pearl oyster meat (adductor muscle)\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 56.4174%;\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYou can import from any country or region if you:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHave documentary proof to verify that the pearl oyster meat products \u003cstrong\u003emeet the following requirements\u003c/strong\u003e:\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eThe pearl oyster meat products are harvested and processed by an establishment regulated by the Competent Authority in the exporting country or region.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eThe pearl oyster meat products are processed under hygienic and sanitary conditions.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eThe pearl oyster meat products meet the \u003ca href=\"/legislation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003eSingapore Food Regulations\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMaintain proper documentation records of the documentary proof. SFA may request to see them as part of inspection checks.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor more details, please refer to this \u003ca href=\"/api/assets/2e941b2a-8874-4d7a-8273-a8451b3403c0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"IMPORT REQUIREMENTS FOR PEARL OYSTER MEAT\"\u003etrade circular\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;on import requirements for pearl oyster meat.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 35.2201%;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 43.5825%;\"\u003ePufferfish (wild and farmed pufferfish muscle meat and farmed pufferfish parts i.e. fins, skin, and milt only)\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 56.4174%;\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYou can only import wild and farmed pufferfish muscle meat and farmed pufferfish parts (fins, skin, and milt) from \u003ca href=\"/tools-and-resources/accreditation-database-for-overseas-sources\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003eSFA-accredited pufferfish establishments approved for export to Singapore\u003c/a\u003e.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEach import consignment must be accompanied by a health certificate issued by the relevant authority of the exporting country or region.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor more details, please see\u0026nbsp;\u003ca href=\"/accreditation-of-overseas-farms-establishments/overseas-accreditation-of-food-food-products#fish-fish-products-4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003eOverseas Accreditation of Food \u0026amp; Food Products - Fish \u0026amp; Fish Products\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 35.2201%;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 43.5825%;\"\u003eSeafood from Chile and Mexico\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 43.5825%;\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"\u003eChile and Mexico\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEach import consignment must be accompanied by a \u003cstrong\u003ehealth certificate\u003c/strong\u003e issued by the relevant authority of the exporting country or region.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe health certificate must certify \u003cspan style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"\u003eand state\u003c/span\u003e that products are \u0026lsquo;\u003cstrong\u003efree from marine biotoxins\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026rsquo;.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 56.4174%;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003c/tbody\u003e\n\u003c/table\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e53:Ted5,\u003chtml\u003e\u003chead\u003e\u003c/head\u003e\u003cbody\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003c/strong\u003ePermits are required for importing fish species under CITES Appendix II and Appendix III. This applies to whole fish, fish parts, and fish derivatives.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThe table below shows some examples of CITES species. Please use \u003ca href=\"https://www.speciesplus.net/species\"\u003eSpecies+\u003c/a\u003e to check if your food or product fall under CITES by entering the scientific name of the animal/fish.\u0026nbsp;The table also shows the corresponding import requirements.\u2028\u003c/p\u003e\u2028\u003cp\u003eYou may write to \u003ca href=\"mailto:CITES@nparks.gov.sg\"\u003eCITES@nparks.gov.sg\u003c/a\u003e for enquiries on CITES matters.\u003c/p\u003e\u2028\u003cdiv class=\"table-text sf_colsIn\" data-sf-element=\"Text Table - Content Block\" data-placeholder-label=\"Text Table - Content Block\"\u003e\u2028 \u003cdiv class=\"sfContentBlock sf-Long-text\"\u003e\u2028 \u003cdiv class=\"table-wrap\"\u003e\u2028 \u003cdiv class=\"table-wrap-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\"\u003e\u2028 \u2028                    \u2028                        \u2028                            \u2028                            \u2028                        \u2028                        \u2028                            \u2028                            \u2028                        \u2028                    \u2028                \u003cdiv class=\"table-wrap\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"table-wrap-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\"\u003e\u003ctable style=\"height:755.319px;width:531px;\"\u003e\u003ctbody\u003e\u003ctr style=\"height:2.50673%;\"\u003e\u003cth style=\"width:50%;\" data-role=\"resizable\"\u003eCITES\u003c/th\u003e\u003cth style=\"width:50%;\"\u003eRequirements\u003c/th\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr style=\"height:73.8582%;\"\u003e\u003ctd style=\"width:50%;\"\u003e\u2028 \u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCITES Appendix \u003c/strong\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eII\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan style=\"text-decoration:underline;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u2028 \u003col\u003e\u2028 \u003cli\u003eSturgeon (\u003cem style=\"box-sizing:border-box;\"\u003eAcipenseriformes\u003c/em\u003e\u0026nbsp;species)\u003c/li\u003e\u2028 \u003cli\u003eWhale shark (Rhincodon typus)\u2028\u2028                                    \u003c/li\u003e\u2028 \u003cli\u003eBasking Shark (\u003cem style=\"box-sizing:border-box;\"\u003eCetorhinus Maximus\u003c/em\u003e)\u2028 \u003c/li\u003e\u2028 \u003cli\u003eSeahorses (Hippocampus species)\u2028                                    \u003c/li\u003e\u2028 \u003cli\u003eAll Thresher sharks (\u003cem\u003eAlopias\u003c/em\u003e species)\u2028                                    \u003c/li\u003e\u2028 \u003cli\u003eHumphead wrasse (\u003cem style=\"box-sizing:border-box;\"\u003eCheilinus undulatus\u003c/em\u003e)\u2028 \u003c/li\u003e\u2028 \u003cli\u003eMediterranean date mussel (\u003cem style=\"box-sizing:border-box;\"\u003eLithophaga lithophaga\u003c/em\u003e)\u2028 \u003c/li\u003e\u2028 \u003cli\u003eMackerel sharks (\u003cem\u003eCarcharodon carcharias\u003c/em\u003e, Isurus \u003cem\u003eoxyrinchus\u003c/em\u003e, \u003cem\u003eIsurus paucus\u003c/em\u003e, \u003cem\u003eLamna nasus\u003c/em\u003e)\u2028 \u003c/li\u003e\u2028 \u003cli\u003eAll Hammerhead sharks (\u003cem\u003eSphyrnidae\u003c/em\u003e species)\u2028                                    \u003c/li\u003e\u2028 \u003cli\u003eAll Requiem sharks (\u003cem\u003eCarcharhinidae\u003c/em\u003e species)\u2028                                    \u003c/li\u003e\u2028 \u003cli\u003eSea cucumbers (\u003cem\u003eThelenota\u003c/em\u003e species)\u2028                                    \u003c/li\u003e\u2028 \u003cli\u003eTeatfishes (\u003cem\u003eHolothuria fuscogilva\u003c/em\u003e, \u003cem\u003eHolothuria nobilis\u003c/em\u003e and \u003cem\u003eHolothuria whitmaei\u003c/em\u003e)\u2028 \u003c/li\u003e\u2028 \u003cli\u003eMobuild rays (\u003cem style=\"box-sizing:border-box;\"\u003eManta spp.\u003c/em\u003e)\u2028 \u003c/li\u003e\u2028 \u003cli\u003eEuropean eel (\u003cem style=\"box-sizing:border-box;\"\u003eAnguilla anguilla\u003c/em\u003e)\u003c/li\u003e\u2028 \u003c/ol\u003e\u2028 \u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u2028 \u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCITES Appendix III\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u2028 \u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u2028 \u003col\u003e\u2028 \u003cli\u003e\"Rock Sea Cucumber\" (\u003cem\u003eIsostichopus\u003c/em\u003e \u003cem\u003efuscus\u003c/em\u003e) from Ecuador\u003c/li\u003e\u2028 \u003c/ol\u003e\u2028 \u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd style=\"width:50%;\"\u003eFor each import consignment, you must obtain \u003cstrong\u003eall the following permits\u003c/strong\u003e:\u003cbr\u003e\u2028 \u003cp\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.nparks.gov.sg/services/import-plant-plant-products/apply-import-permit\"\u003ea CITES import permit from NParks\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u2028 \u003cp\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://avs.nparks.gov.sg/businesses/commercial-importers-exporters/animals/wildlife-endangered-species/\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003ea CITES export/re-export permit from country or region of export\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u2028 \u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/tbody\u003e\u003c/table\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u2028 \u003c/div\u003e\u2028 \u003c/div\u003e\u2028\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/body\u003e\u003c/html\u003e54:T47f,\u003chtml\u003e\u003chead\u003e\u003c/head\u003e\u003cbody\u003e\u003cp\u003eFish and fish products that are not classified as ‘high-risk’ and not under CITES can be imported from any country or region without the need to obtain a health certificate.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr\u003eIf your food or food products are classified as ‘high-risk’ or under CITES, you must comply with the import requirements listed in the table above.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"callout-type\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"tip-notification\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://assets.app.optical.gov.sg/sfa/production/published/collections/pages/%252Ffood-import-export%252Fcommercial-imports%252Fimport-requirements-for-food-food-products/18ebc740-fefb-4062-b132-b8c48257dc52.svg\" alt=\"Icon Tip\" title=\"Icon Success Notification\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"notification-content\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003eThe most common mistakes made by traders is the incomplete submission of the required documents, such as omission of health certificates, or health certificates that do not have all required information.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eTo avoid delays in processing your application, you must ensure that the documents for each import consignment of food or food products are complete.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/body\u003e\u003c/html\u003e55:T63f,\u003chtml\u003e\u003chead\u003e\u003c/head\u003e\u003cbody\u003e\u003cp\u003eEvery carton and basic packaging unit of your imported Fish and Fish Products \u003cstrong\u003emust\u003c/strong\u003e be labelled with the following information:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003edescription of the fish product\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003ecountry/region of origin of the fish product\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003ebrand name of the fish product (if any)\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003ename and designation number of the processing establishment (if applicable)\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003edate that the fish product was processed.\u0026nbsp;The labels of all \u003cstrong\u003eprocessed fish products\u003c/strong\u003e must include the name and designation number of the establishment, and the date on which the fish was processed.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003ename and designation number of the establishment that packed the fish product and the date of packing\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003ebatch number, location and canning code of the fish product\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003enet weight of the fish product in each basic packaging and outer carton\u2028\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"callout-type\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"tip-notification\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://assets.app.optical.gov.sg/sfa/production/published/collections/pages/%252Ffood-import-export%252Fcommercial-imports%252Fimport-requirements-for-food-food-products/18ebc740-fefb-4062-b132-b8c48257dc52.svg\" alt=\"Icon Tip\" title=\"Icon Success Notification\"\u003e\u2028 \u003cdiv class=\"notification-content\"\u003eYou must inform your supplier or exporter to comply with the SFA's labelling requirements.\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003eFor more details, see\u003ca target=\"_blank\" href=\"/regulatory-standards-frameworks-guidelines/food-labelling-packaging-guidelines/labelling-requirements-for-food\"\u003e Labelling Requirements for Food\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u2028 \u003c/div\u003e\u2028\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/body\u003e\u003c/html\u003e39:[\"$\",\"div\",\"746\",{\"className\":\"sf_colsIn row tab-pane\",\"role\":\"tabpanel\",\"data-placeholder-label\":\"Tab Items\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h4\",\"4291\",{\"className\":\"tab-section-title\",\"data-text\":\"Fish \u0026 Fish Products\",\"children\":\"Fish \u0026 Fish Products\"}],[\"$\",\"$L2c\",\"4292\",{\"data\":{\"id\":1243,\"date_created\":\"2026-10-11T18:01:45.460Z\",\"user_updated\":null,\"date_updated\":null,\"title\":\"Content Overview\"},\"blockId\":\"4292\",\"itemId\":1243,\"pageId\":\"$undefined\",\"detailData\":\"$undefined\",\"lastUpdated\":\"$undefined\",\"pageTitle\":\"$undefined\",\"current_permalink\":\"$undefined\"}],[\"$\",\"h4\",\"4293\",{\"id\":\"what-food-or-food-products-must-meet-the-import-requirements-for-fish-fish-products\",\"className\":\"anchor-section-title\",\"data-text\":\"What food or food products must meet the import requirements for Fish \u0026 Fish Products?\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"4294\",{\"className\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"sfContentBlock sf-Long-text\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"\u003chtml\u003e\u003chead\u003e\u003c/head\u003e\u003cbody\u003e\u003ch2\u003eWhat food or food products must meet the import requirements for Fish \u0026amp; Fish Products?\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eFood or food products classified as ‘Fish \u0026amp; Fish Products’, including types of seafood (e.g. live fish, canned tuna, crabs, prawns, sea cucumbers, and squids) must meet the import requirements imposed on this category of food or food products.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eTo check if your food or food product falls under ‘Fish \u0026amp; Fish Products’, use the  \u003ca target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"/tools-and-resources/food-and-related-products-classification-tool\\\"\u003eFood and Related Products Classification Tool\u003c/a\u003e. To learn more about the different categories of food and food products, see the  \u003ca target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"/food-import-export/general-classification-of-food-food-products/classification-of-general-food-food-products\\\"\u003eClassification of General Food \u0026amp; Food Products.\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/body\u003e\u003c/html\u003e\"},\"data-directus\":\"$undefined\",\"suppressHydrationWarning\":true}]}],[\"$\",\"h4\",\"4295\",{\"id\":\"where-can-i-find-the-import-requirements-for-fish-fish-products\",\"className\":\"anchor-section-title\",\"data-text\":\"Where can I find the import requirements for Fish \u0026 Fish Products?\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"4296\",{\"className\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"sfContentBlock sf-Long-text\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"\u003chtml\u003e\u003chead\u003e\u003c/head\u003e\u003cbody\u003e\u003ch2\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003ch2\u003eWhere can I find the import requirements for Fish \u0026amp; Fish Products?\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe import requirements for Fish and Fish products can be found in the  \u003ca target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"/legislation/wholesome-meat-and-fish-act-1999\\\"\u003eWholesome Meat and Fish (Import, Export and Transhipment) Rules\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eYou must comply with these requirements before you  \u003ca href=\\\"/food-import-export/commercial-imports/what-you-need-to-know-for-import-of-food#import-permit\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"\u003eapply for an import permit\u003c/a\u003e to bring Fish \u0026amp; Fish Products into Singapore.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eNon-compliance can result in penalties under the\u0026nbsp;\u003ca href=\\\"/legislation\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"\u003eprevailing food safety laws and regulations\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/body\u003e\u003c/html\u003e\"},\"data-directus\":\"$undefined\",\"suppressHydrationWarning\":true}]}],[\"$\",\"h4\",\"4297\",{\"id\":\"how-do-i-comply-with-the-import-requirements-for-fish-fish-products\",\"className\":\"anchor-section-title\",\"data-text\":\"How do I comply with the import requirements for Fish \u0026 Fish Products?\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"4298\",{\"className\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"sfContentBlock sf-Long-text\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"\u003chtml\u003e\u003chead\u003e\u003c/head\u003e\u003cbody\u003e\u003ch2\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003ch2\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003ch2\u003eHow do I comply with the import requirements for Fish \u0026amp; Fish Products?\u003c/h2\u003e\u003c/body\u003e\u003c/html\u003e\"},\"data-directus\":\"$undefined\",\"suppressHydrationWarning\":true}]}],[\"$\",\"$L49\",\"4299\",{\"data\":{\"id\":1358,\"sort\":null,\"user_created\":\"211f17e7-d30c-4260-909a-156da2993df4\",\"date_created\":\"2026-10-11T18:01:45.501Z\",\"user_updated\":\"211f17e7-d30c-4260-909a-156da2993df4\",\"date_updated\":\"202