pdated\":\"211f17e7-d30c-4260-909a-156da2993df4\",\"date_updated\":\"2026-10-22T08:38:09.433Z\",\"content\":[{\"id\":4266,\"Sfacorp_TabItem_id\":744,\"collection\":\"Sfacorp_InPageTabTitle\",\"sort\":1,\"item\":{\"id\":744,\"status\":\"published\",\"sort\":null,\"user_created\":\"211f17e7-d30c-4260-909a-156da2993df4\",\"date_created\":\"2026-10-11T18:01:45.217Z\",\"user_updated\":null,\"date_updated\":null,\"tab_title\":\"Meat and Meat Products\"}},{\"id\":4267,\"Sfacorp_TabItem_id\":744,\"collection\":\"Sfacorp_ContentOverview\",\"sort\":2,\"item\":{\"id\":1241,\"date_created\":\"2026-10-11T18:01:45.223Z\",\"user_updated\":null,\"date_updated\":null,\"title\":\"Content Overview\"}},{\"id\":4268,\"Sfacorp_TabItem_id\":744,\"collection\":\"Sfacorp_AnchorItem\",\"sort\":3,\"item\":{\"id\":4798,\"status\":\"published\",\"sort\":null,\"user_created\":\"211f17e7-d30c-4260-909a-156da2993df4\",\"date_created\":\"2026-10-11T18:01:45.227Z\",\"user_updated\":null,\"date_updated\":null,\"section_title\":\"What food or food products must meet the import requirements for Meat \u0026 Meat Products?\",\"linked\":null}},{\"id\":4269,\"Sfacorp_TabItem_id\":744,\"collection\":\"Sfacorp_ContentBlock\",\"sort\":4,\"item\":{\"id\":12228,\"status\":\"published\",\"sort\":null,\"user_created\":\"211f17e7-d30c-4260-909a-156da2993df4\",\"date_created\":\"2026-10-11T18:01:45.232Z\",\"user_updated\":null,\"date_updated\":null,\"body\":\"\u003chtml\u003e\u003chead\u003e\u003c/head\u003e\u003cbody\u003e\u003ch2\u003eWhat food or food products must meet the import requirements for Meat \u0026amp; Meat Products?\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eImports classified as ‘Meat \u0026amp; Meat Products’ must meet the import requirements imposed on this category of food or food products. Examples of ‘Meat \u0026amp; Meat Products’ include, but are not limited to, fresh poultry and meats, pizza with meat toppings and barbequed meats (bak kwa).\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eTo check if your food or food product falls under ‘Meat \u0026amp; Meat Products’, use the  \u003ca target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"/tools-and-resources/food-and-related-products-classification-tool\\\"\u003eFood and Related Products Classification Tool\u003c/a\u003e. To learn more about the different categories of food and food products, see the  \u003ca target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"/food-import-export/general-classification-of-food-food-products/classification-of-general-food-food-products\\\"\u003eClassification of General Food \u0026amp; Food Products.\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/body\u003e\u003c/html\u003e\",\"title\":\"Import Requirements for Food \u0026 Food Products\",\"feedback\":null,\"optical_publish-rjcg9p\":null,\"publish_ready\":false,\"table_text\":false,\"show_for_page_layout\":false,\"wrapper_css_class\":null,\"exclude_from_search_index\":false}},{\"id\":4270,\"Sfacorp_TabItem_id\":744,\"collection\":\"Sfacorp_AnchorItem\",\"sort\":5,\"item\":{\"id\":4799,\"status\":\"published\",\"sort\":null,\"user_created\":\"211f17e7-d30c-4260-909a-156da2993df4\",\"date_created\":\"2026-10-11T18:01:45.240Z\",\"user_updated\":null,\"date_updated\":null,\"section_title\":\"Where can I find the import requirements for Meat \u0026 Meat Products?\",\"linked\":null}},{\"id\":4271,\"Sfacorp_TabItem_id\":744,\"collection\":\"Sfacorp_ContentBlock\",\"sort\":6,\"item\":{\"id\":12229,\"status\":\"published\",\"sort\":null,\"user_created\":\"211f17e7-d30c-4260-909a-156da2993df4\",\"date_created\":\"2026-10-11T18:01:45.245Z\",\"user_updated\":null,\"date_updated\":null,\"body\":\"\u003chtml\u003e\u003chead\u003e\u003c/head\u003e\u003cbody\u003e\u003ch2\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003ch2\u003eWhere can I find the import requirements for Meat \u0026amp; Meat Products?\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe import requirements can be found in the  \u003ca target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"/legislation/wholesome-meat-and-fish-act-1999\\\"\u003eWholesome Meat and Fish (Import, Export and Transhipment) Rules\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eYou must comply with the import requirements before you \u003ca target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"/food-import-export/commercial-imports/what-you-need-to-know-for-import-of-food#import-permit\\\"\u003eapply for an import permit\u003c/a\u003e to bring Meat \u0026amp; Meat Products into Singapore.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eNon-compliance can result in penalties under the\u0026nbsp;\u003ca target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"/legislation\\\"\u003eprevailing food safety laws and regulations\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/body\u003e\u003c/html\u003e\",\"title\":\"Import Requirements for Food \u0026 Food Products\",\"feedback\":null,\"optical_publish-rjcg9p\":null,\"publish_ready\":false,\"table_text\":false,\"show_for_page_layout\":false,\"wrapper_css_class\":null,\"exclude_from_search_index\":false}},{\"id\":4272,\"Sfacorp_TabItem_id\":744,\"collection\":\"Sfacorp_AnchorItem\",\"sort\":7,\"item\":{\"id\":4800,\"status\":\"published\",\"sort\":null,\"user_created\":\"211f17e7-d30c-4260-909a-156da2993df4\",\"date_created\":\"2026-10-11T18:01:45.254Z\",\"user_updated\":null,\"date_updated\":null,\"section_title\":\"How do I comply with the import requirements for Meat \u0026 Meat Products?\",\"linked\":null}},{\"id\":4273,\"Sfacorp_TabItem_id\":744,\"collection\":\"Sfacorp_ContentBlock\",\"sort\":8,\"item\":{\"id\":12230,\"status\":\"published\",\"sort\":null,\"user_created\":\"211f17e7-d30c-4260-909a-156da2993df4\",\"date_created\":\"2026-10-11T18:01:45.258Z\",\"user_updated\":null,\"date_updated\":null,\"body\":\"\u003chtml\u003e\u003chead\u003e\u003c/head\u003e\u003cbody\u003e\u003ch2\u003eHow do I comply with the import requirements for Meat \u0026amp; Meat Products?\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/body\u003e\u003c/html\u003e\",\"title\":\"Import Requirements for Food \u0026 Food Products\",\"feedback\":null,\"optical_publish-rjcg9p\":null,\"publish_ready\":false,\"table_text\":false,\"show_for_page_l