"accordion_item\":\"$35:props:data:accordion_item\",\"accordion_items\":\"$35:props:data:accordion_items\",\"accordion_sub_header\":\"$35:props:data:accordion_sub_header\"}},{\"id\":4278,\"Sfacorp_TabItem_id\":744,\"collection\":\"Sfacorp_AnchorItem\",\"sort\":13,\"item\":{\"id\":4802,\"status\":\"published\",\"sort\":null,\"user_created\":\"211f17e7-d30c-4260-909a-156da2993df4\",\"date_created\":\"2026-10-11T18:01:45.347Z\",\"user_updated\":null,\"date_updated\":null,\"section_title\":\"How do these import requirements ensure the food safety of Meat and Meat Products?\",\"linked\":null}},{\"id\":4279,\"Sfacorp_TabItem_id\":744,\"collection\":\"Sfacorp_ContentBlock\",\"sort\":14,\"item\":{\"id\":12232,\"status\":\"published\",\"sort\":null,\"user_created\":\"211f17e7-d30c-4260-909a-156da2993df4\",\"date_created\":\"2026-10-11T18:01:45.351Z\",\"user_updated\":null,\"date_updated\":null,\"body\":\"\u003chtml\u003e\u003chead\u003e\u003c/head\u003e\u003cbody\u003e\u003ch2\u003eHow do these import requirements ensure the food safety of Meat and Meat Products?\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eSFA adopts a science and risk-based approach to ensure that food is safe for consumption in Singapore. The requirements imposed ensures food safety and reduce the risk of foodborne illnesses.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAs meat has a higher risk of being contaminated with pathogens compared to processed food or vegetables, SFA requires all meat to be imported only from approved sources or accredited establishments. SFA also requires every consignment to be accompanied by a veterinary health certificate to ensure that your imports comply with Singapore's animal health and food safety requirements.\\n\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdiv\u003eThe labelling requirements also provide consumers with the information to make informed choices. It also improves traceability in the event of food safety issues or recalls.\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/body\u003e\u003c/html\u003e\",\"title\":\"Import Requirements 