1:45.553Z\",\"user_updated\":null,\"date_updated\":null,\"section_title\":\"What food or food products must meet the import requirements for Fresh Fruits \u0026 Vegetables?\",\"linked\":null}},{\"id\":4305,\"Sfacorp_TabItem_id\":747,\"collection\":\"Sfacorp_ContentBlock\",\"sort\":4,\"item\":{\"id\":12241,\"status\":\"published\",\"sort\":null,\"user_created\":\"211f17e7-d30c-4260-909a-156da2993df4\",\"date_created\":\"2026-10-11T18:01:45.557Z\",\"user_updated\":null,\"date_updated\":null,\"body\":\"\u003chtml\u003e\u003chead\u003e\u003c/head\u003e\u003cbody\u003e\u003ch2\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003ch2\u003eWhat food or food products must meet the import requirements for Fresh Fruits \u0026amp; Vegetables?\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eFood or food products classified as ‘Fresh Fruits \u0026amp; Vegetables’ include, but are not limited to, fresh apples, fresh durians, fresh potatoes, and raw ginger among others. Each import consignment must meet the requirements imposed on this category of food or food products.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/body\u003e\u003c/html\u003e\",\"title\":\"Import Requirements for Food \u0026 Food Products\",\"feedback\":null,\"optical_publish-rjcg9p\":null,\"publish_ready\":false,\"table_text\":false,\"show_for_page_layout\":false,\"wrapper_css_class\":null,\"exclude_from_search_index\":false}},{\"id\":4306,\"Sfacorp_TabItem_id\":747,\"collection\":\"Sfacorp_CalloutsBlock\",\"sort\":5,\"item\":{\"id\":1446,\"status\":\"published\",\"sort\":null,\"user_created\":\"211f17e7-d30c-4260-909a-156da2993df4\",\"date_created\":\"2026-10-11T18:01:45.565Z\",\"user_updated\":null,\"date_updated\":null,\"callouts_title\":\"\",\"tooltip_is_enable\":false,\"tooltip_content\":\"\",\"callouts_content\":\"\u003chtml\u003e\u003chead\u003e\u003c/head\u003e\u003cbody\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:#ff6666;\\\"\u003eFruits and vegetables that have undergone processing e.g. cutting, peeling, canning, and freezing, are classified as ‘Processed Food’ and must comply with the \u003c/span\u003e\u003ca target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"/food-import-export/commercial-imports/import-requirements-for-food-food-products#processed-food--food-appliances-4\\\"\u003eimport requirements for processed food\u003c/a\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:#ff6666;\\\"\u003e instead.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/body\u003e\u003c/html\u003e\",\"callouts_type\":\"Warning\",\"feedback\":null}},{\"id\":4307,\"Sfacorp_TabItem_id\":747,\"collection\":\"Sfacorp_ContentBlock\",\"sort\":6,\"item\":{\"id\":12242,\"status\":\"published\",\"sort\":null,\"user_created\":\"211f17e7-d30c-4260-909a-156da2993df4\",\"date_created\":\"2026-10-11T18:01:45.569Z\",\"user_updated\":null,\"date_updated\":null,\"body\":\"\u003chtml\u003e\u003chead\u003e\u003c/head\u003e\u003cbody\u003e\u003ch2\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eTo check if your food or food products fall under ‘Fresh Fruits \u0026amp; Vegetables’, use the  \u003ca target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"/tools-and-resources/food-and-related-products-classification-tool\\\"\u003eFood and Related Products Classification Tool\u003c/a\u003e. For more information on the different categories of food and food products, see the  \u003ca target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"/food-import-export/general-classification-of-food-food-products/classification-of-general-food-food-products\\\"\u003eClassification of General Food \u0026amp; Food Products.\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/body\u003e\u003c/html\u003e\",\"title\":\"Import Requirements for Food \u0026 Food Products\",\"feedback\":null,\"optical_publish-rjcg9p\":null,\"publish_ready\":false,\"table_text\":false,\"show_for_page_layout\":false,\"wrapper_css_class\":null,\"exclude_from_search_index\":false}},{\"id\":4308,\"Sfacorp_TabItem_id\":747,\"collection\":\"Sfacorp_AnchorItem\",\"sort\":7,\"item\":{\"id\":4812,\"status\":\"published\",\"sort\":null,\"user_created\":\"211f17e7-d30c-4260-909a-156da2993df4\",\"date_created\":\"2026-10-11T18:01:45.576Z\",\"user_updated\":null,\"date_updated\":null,\"section_title\":\"Where can I find the import requirements for Fresh Fruits and Vegetables?\",\"linked\":null}},{\"id\":4309,\"Sfacorp_TabItem_id\":747,\"collection\":\"Sfacorp_ContentBlock\",\"sort\":8,\"item\":{\"id\":12243,\"status\":\"published\",\"sort\":null,\"user_created\":\"211f17e7-d30c-4260-909a-156da2993df4\",\"date_created\":\"2026-10-11T18:01:45.580Z\",\"user_updated\":null,\"date_updated\":null,\"body\":\"\u003chtml\u003e\u003chead\u003e\u003c/head\u003e\u003cbody\u003e\u003ch2\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003ch2\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003ch2\u003eWhere can I find the import requirements for Fresh Fruits and Vegetables?\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe import requirements can be found in the    \u003ca href=\\\"https://cuge.nparks.gov.sg/farm-licence/copa-farm-license/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" data-sf-ec-immutable=\\\"\\\" data-sf-marked=\\\"\\\"\u003eControl of Plants (Import \u0026amp; Transhipment of Fresh Fruits \u0026amp; Vegetables) Rules.\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eYou must comply with these requirements before you \u003ca target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"/food-import-export/commercial-imports/what-you-need-to-know-for-import-of-food#import-permit\\\"\u003eapply for an import permit\u003c/a\u003e to bring Fresh Fruits \u0026amp; Vegetables into Singapore.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eNon-compliance can result in penalties under the\u0026nbsp;\u003ca target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"/legislation\\\"\u003eprevailing food safety laws and regulations\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/body\u003e\u003c/html\u003e\",\"title\":\"Import Requirements for Food \u0026 Food Products\",\"feedback\":null,\"optical_publish-rjcg9p\":null,\"publish_ready\":false,\"table_text\":false,\"show_for_page_layout\":false,\"wrapper_css_class\":null,\"exclude_from_search_index\":false}},{\"id\":4310,\"Sfacorp_TabItem_id\":747,\"collection\":\"Sfacorp_AnchorItem\",\"sort\":9,\"item\":{\"id\":4813,\"status\":\"published\",\"sort\":null,\"user_created\":\"211f17e7-d30c-4260-909a-156da2993df4\",\"date_created\":\"2026-10-11T18:01:45.587Z\",\"user_updated\":null,\"date_updated\":null,\"section_title\":\"How do I comply with the import requirements for Fresh Fruits \u0026 Vegetables?\",\"linked\":null}},{\"id\":4311,\"Sfacorp_TabItem_id\":747,\"collection\":\"Sfacorp_ContentBlock\",\"sort\":10,\"item\":{\"id\":12244,\"status\":\"published\",\"sort\":null,\"user_created\":\"211f17e7-d30c-4260-909a-156da2993df4\",\"date_created\":\"2026-10-11T18:01:45.591Z\",\"user_updated\":null,\"date_updated\":null,\"body\":\"\u003chtml\u003e\u003chead\u003e\u003c/head\u003e\u003cbody\u003e\u003ch2\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003ch2\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003ch2\u003eHow do I comply with the import requirements for Fresh Fruits \u0026amp; Vegetables?\u003c/h2\u003e\u003c/body\u003e\u003c/html\u003e\",\"title\":\"Import Requirements for Food \u0026 Food Products\",\"feedback\":null,\"optical_publish-rjcg9p\":null,\"publish_ready\":false,\"table_text\":false,\"show_for_page_layout\":false,\"wrapper_css_class\":null,\"exclude_from_search_index\":false}},{\"id\":4312,\"Sfacorp_TabItem_id\":747,\"collection\":\"Sfacorp_AccordionLayout\",\"sort\":11,\"item\":{\"id\":1359,\"sort\":null,\"user_created\":\"211f17e7-d30c-4260-909a-156da2993df4\",\"date_created\":\"2026-10-11T18:01:45.601Z\",\"user_updated\":null,\"date_updated\":null,\"title\":null,\"accordion_item\":[],\"accordion_items\":[{\"id\":3576,\"Sfacorp_AccordionLayout_id\":1359,\"sort\":1,\"Sfacorp_AccordionItem_id\":{\"id\":3609,\"status\":\"published\",\"sort\":null,\"user_created\":\"211f17e7-d30c-4260-909a-156da2993df4\",\"date_created\":\"2026-10-11T18:01:45.602Z\",\"user_updated\":null,\"date_updated\":null,\"title\":\"Step 1: Check the pesticides used\",\"duration_of_application\":\"\",\"accordion_content\":\"\u003chtml\u003e\u003chead\u003e\u003c/head\u003e\u003cbody\u003e\u003cp\u003eYou can import Fresh Fruits \u0026amp; Vegetables from any region/country. However, you must ensure that all imported fresh fruits and vegetables \u003cstrong\u003edo not contain\u003c/strong\u003e any of the following:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003eprohibited pesticides. For the list of SFA-approved agricultural pesticides, go to \u003ca target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"/tools-and-resources/pesticides-search\\\" sfref=\\\"[f669d9a7-009d-4d83-ddaa-000000000002]6f197588-d4f1-4a85-a769-d4f46c28c0f5\\\"\u003ePesticide Search Tool\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003elevels of pesticide residue or toxic chemical residue exceeding the prescribed levels specified in the Ninth Schedule of the \u003ca target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"/legislation\\\"\u003eFood Regulations\u003c/a\u003e or recommended by the \u003ca target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"http://www.codexalimentarius.org/\\\"\u003eJoint FAO/WHO Codex Alimentarius Commission\u003c/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003eYou can obtain the laboratory test results from your supplier to check the pesticides used and if it exceeds the prescribed levels.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/body\u003e\u003c/html\u003e\"}},{\"id\":3577,\"Sfacorp_AccordionLayout_id\":1359,\"sort\":2,\"Sfacorp_AccordionItem_id\":{\"id\":3610,\"status\":\"published\",\"sort\":null,\"user_created\":\"211f17e7-d30c-4260-909a-156da2993df4\",\"date_created\":\"2026-10-11T18:01:45.609Z\",\"user_updated\":null,\"date_updated\":null,\"title\":\"Step 2: Ensure the food labels are accurate and complete\",\"duration_of_application\":\"\",\"accordion_content\":\"$79\"}}],\"accordion_sub_header\":{\"id\":1359,\"sort\":null,\"user_created\":\"211f17e7-d30c-4260-909a-156da2993df4\",\"date_created\":\"2026-10-11T18:01:45.600Z\",\"user_updated\":null,\"date_updated\":null,\"sub_header\":\"\",\"template_name\":\"Detail.AccordionSubHeader\"}}},{\"id\":4313,\"Sfacorp_TabItem_id\":747,\"collection\":\"Sfacorp_AnchorItem\",\"sort\":12,\"item\":{\"id\":4814,\"status\":\"published\",\"sort\":null,\"user_created\":\"211f17e7-d30c-4260-909a-156da2993df4\",\"date_created\":\"2026-10-11T18:01:45.617Z\",\"user_updated\":null,\"date_updated\":null,\"section_title\":\"How do these import requirements ensure the food safety of Fresh Fruits \u0026 Vegetables?\",\"linked\":null}},{\"id\":4314,\"Sfacorp_TabItem_id\":747,\"collection\":\"Sfacorp_ContentBlock\",\"sort\":13,\"item\":{\"id\":12245,\"status\":\"published\",\"sort\":null,\"user_created\":\"211f17e7-d30c-4260-909a-156da2993df4\",\"date_created\":\"2026-10-11T18:01:45.622Z\",\"user_updated\":null,\"date_updated\":null,\"body\":\"\u003chtml\u003e\u003chead\u003e\u003c/head\u003e\u003cbody\u003e\u003ch2\u003eHow do these import requirements ensure the food safety of Fresh Fruits \u0026amp; Vegetables?\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eSFA adopts a science and risk-based approach to ensure that food is safe for consumption in Singapore. The requirements imposed ensure food safety and reduce the risk of foodborne illnesses.\u0026nbsp;These requirements ensure that imported fresh fruits and vegetables are safe for consumption.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFor instance, the requirement to check the pesticides used and to ensure that it does not exceed the prevailing limits ensures that the imported consignments do not contain any prohibited pesticides which may be harmful when consumed.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe labelling requirements also provide consumers with the information to make informed choices. It also improves traceability in the event of food safety issues or recalls.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/body\u003e\u003c/html\u003e\",\"title\":\"Import Requirements for Food \u0026 Food Products\",\"feedback\":null,\"optical_publish-rjcg9p\":null,\"publish_ready\":false,\"table_text\":false,\"show_for_page_layout\":false,\"wrapper_css_class\":null,\"exclude_from_search_index\":false}}]}},{\"id\":748,\"Sfacorp_TabSection_id\":467,\"collection\":\"Sfacorp_TabItem\",\"sort\":5,\"item\":{\"id\":748,\"status\":\"published\",\"sort\":null,\"user_created\":\"211f17e7-d30c-4260-909a