 Enhanced Regulated Source Programme before you submit an application to SFA for an import permit\",\"duration_of_application\":\"\",\"accordion_content\":\"$7d\"}},{\"id\":3579,\"Sfacorp_AccordionLayout_id\":1360,\"sort\":2,\"Sfacorp_AccordionItem_id\":{\"id\":3612,\"status\":\"published\",\"sort\":null,\"user_created\":\"211f17e7-d30c-4260-909a-156da2993df4\",\"date_created\":\"2026-10-11T18:01:45.705Z\",\"user_updated\":null,\"date_updated\":null,\"title\":\"Step 2 (Optional): Send products to accredited laboratories for analysis\",\"duration_of_application\":\"\",\"accordion_content\":\"\u003chtml\u003e\u003chead\u003e\u003c/head\u003e\u003cbody\u003e\u003cp\u003eWhile not mandatory, you are encouraged to have quality control checks on the food or food products by sending them to accredited laboratories for analysis before you import them.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThis way, you can be more certain that your food or food products comply with the food safety standards and food regulations.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe time and costs for lab tests vary depending on the type of food product tested and the specific testing procedures.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003ePlease refer to the \u003ca target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"http://www.sac-accreditation.gov.sg/\\\"\u003eSingapore Accreditation Council-Singapore Laboratory Accreditation Scheme (SAC-SINGLAS) website\u003c/a\u003e for the list of accredited laboratories.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/body\u003e\u003c/html\u003e\"}}],\"accordion_sub_header\":{\"id\":1360,\"sort\":null,\"user_created\":\"211f17e7-d30c-4260-909a-156da2993df4\",\"date_created\":\"2026-10-11T18:01:45.698Z\",\"user_updated\":null,\"date_updated\":null,\"sub_header\":\"\",\"template_name\":\"Detail.AccordionSubHeader\"}}},{\"id\":4326,\"Sfacorp_TabItem_id\":748,\"collection\":\"Sfacorp_AnchorItem\",\"sort\":12,\"item\":{\"id\":4819,\"status\":\"published\",\"sort\":null,\"user_created\":\"211f17e7-d30c-4260-909a-156da2993df4\",\"date_created\":\"2026-10-11T1