g food safety management and assurance programmes, which ensure that their food or food products comply with Singapore’s food safety standards and laws, will be registered.\u003c/p\u003eYou may register your supplier of infant cereal products under this scheme by following the steps below:\u0026nbsp;\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/body\u003e\u003c/html\u003e\",\"title\":\"Import Requirements for Food \u0026 Food Products\",\"feedback\":null,\"optical_publish-rjcg9p\":null,\"publish_ready\":false,\"table_text\":false,\"show_for_page_layout\":false,\"wrapper_css_class\":null,\"exclude_from_search_index\":false}},{\"id\":4330,\"Sfacorp_TabItem_id\":748,\"collection\":\"Sfacorp_AccordionLayout\",\"sort\":16,\"item\":{\"id\":1361,\"sort\":null,\"user_created\":\"211f17e7-d30c-4260-909a-156da2993df4\",\"date_created\":\"2026-10-11T18:01:45.737Z\",\"user_updated\":null,\"date_updated\":null,\"title\":null,\"accordion_item\":[],\"accordion_items\":[{\"id\":3580,\"Sfacorp_AccordionLayout_id\":1361,\"sort\":1,\"Sfacorp_AccordionItem_id\":{\"id\":3613,\"status\":\"published\",\"sort\":null,\"user_created\":\"211f17e7-d30c-4260-909a-156da2993df4\",\"date_created\":\"2026-10-11T18:01:45.738Z\",\"user_updated\":null,\"date_updated\":null,\"title\":\"Step 1: Ensure your supplier and the food or food products you intend to import meet all pre-import requirements\",\"duration_of_application\":\"\",\"accordion_content\":\"\u003chtml\u003e\u003chead\u003e\u003c/head\u003e\u003cbody\u003e\u003cp\u003ePlease refer to the\u0026nbsp;\u003ca target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"/api/assets/8bfc9be2-d97a-4f71-af09-764b3879bb83\\\" aria-label=\\\"Template Supplier Verification Checklist for Infant Cereal Products (DOC)\\\"\u003esupplier verification checklist\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;for the supporting documents required for verification. Your supplier can be a manufacturer, producer, or consolidator.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eIf your supplier is a consolidator, you should ensure that the information used for the verification is obtained either directly from the manufacturer or producer. \u003c/p\u003eRetain the original documents as you will need to produce them at SFA's request.\u003cp style=\\\"line-height:120%;\\\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/body\u003e\u003c/html\u003e\"}},{\"id\":3581,\"Sfacorp_AccordionLayout_id\":1361,\"sort\":2,\"Sfacorp_AccordionItem_id\":{\"id\":3614,\"status\":\"published\",\"sort\":null,\"user_created\":\"211f17e7-d30c-4260-909a-156da2993df4\",\"date_created\":\"2026-10-11T18:01:45.742Z\",\"user_updated\":null,\"date_updated\":null,\"title\":\"Step 2: Register your supplier\",\"duration_of_application\":\"\",\"accordion_content\":\"\u003chtml\u003e\u003chead\u003e\u003c/head\u003e\u003cbody\u003e\u003cp\u003eSubmit the \u003ca target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"https://form.gov.sg/63ea05a1b1cf75001146900a\\\"\u003eSupplier Registration (Infant Cereal Products) form\u003c/a\u003e to register your supplier under this voluntary scheme. There are no fees.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/body\u003e\u003c/html\u003e\"}},{\"id\":3582,\"Sfacorp_AccordionLayout_id\":1361,\"sort\":3,\"Sfacorp_AccordionItem_id\":{\"id\":3615,\"status\":\"published\",\"sort\":null,\"user_created\":\"211f17e7-d30c-4260-909a-156da2993df4\",\"date_created\":\"2026-10-11T18:01:45.747Z\",\"user_updated\":null,\"date_updated\":null,\"title\":\"Step 3: Receive establishment code upon approval\",\"duration_of_application\":\"\",\"accordion_content\":\"$7f\"}},{\"id\":3583,\"Sfacorp_AccordionLayout_id\":1361,\"sort\":4,\"Sfacorp_AccordionItem_id\":{\"id\":3616,\"status\":\"published\",\"sort\":null,\"user_created\":\"211f17e7-d30c-4260-909a-156da2993df4\",\"date_created\":\"2026-10-11T18:01:45.751Z\",\"user_updated\":null,\"date_updated\":null,\"title\":\"Step 4 (Optional): Send products to accredited laboratories for analysis\",\"duration_of_application\":\"\",\"accordion_content\":\"\u003chtml\u003e\u003chead\u003e\u003c/head\u003e\u003cbody\u003e\u003cp\u003eWhile not mandatory, you are encouraged to have quality control checks on the food or food products by sending them to accredited laboratories for analysis before you import them.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThis way, you can be more certain that your food or food products comply with the food safety standards and food regulations.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe time and costs for lab tests vary depending on the type of food product tested and the specific testing procedures.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003ePlease refer to the \u003ca target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"http://www.sac-accreditation.gov.sg/\\\"\u003eSingapore Accreditation Council-Singapore Laboratory Accreditation Scheme (SAC-SINGLAS) website\u003c/a\u003e for the list of accredited laboratories.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/body\u003e\u003c/html\u003e\"}}],\"accordion_sub_header\":{\"id\":1361,\"sort\":null,\"user_created\":\"211f17e7-d30c-4260-909a-156da2993df4\",\"date_created\":\"2026-10-11T18:01:45.736Z\",\"user_updated\":null,\"date_updated\":null,\"sub_header\":\"\",\"template_name\":\"Detail.AccordionSubHeader\"}}},{\"id\":4331,\"Sfacorp_TabItem_id\":748,\"collection\":\"Sfacorp_AnchorItem\",\"sort\":17,\"item\":{\"id\":4821,\"status\":\"published\",\"sort\":null,\"user_created\":\"211f17e7-d30c-4260-909a-156da2993df4\",\"date_created\":\"2026-10-11T18:01:45.759Z\",\"user_updated\":null,\"date_updated\":null,\"section_title\":\"How do we ensure the food safety of imported Processed Food \u0026 Food Contact Articles?\",\"linked\":null}},{\"id\":4332,\"Sfacorp_TabItem_id\":748,\"collection\":\"Sfacorp_ContentBlock\",\"sort\":18,\"item\":{\"id\":12252,\"status\":\"published\",\"sort\":null,\"user_created\":\"211f17e7-d30c-4260-909a-156da2993df4\",\"date_created\":\"2026-10-11T18:01:45.763Z\",\"user_updated\":null,\"date_updated\":null,\"body\":\"\u003chtml\u003e\u003chead\u003e\u003c/head\u003e\u003cbody\u003e\u003ch2\u003eHow do we ensure the food safety of imported Processed Food \u0026amp; Food Contact Articles?\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eSFA adopts a science and risk-based approach to ensure that food is safe for consumption in Singapore.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eSFA samples imported food for regulatory testing, with a focus on food that are of higher food safety risks.\u0026nbsp;Food that does not meet our regulatory requirements will not be allowed for import or sale in Singapore.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/body\u003e\u003c/html\u003e\",\"title\":\"Import Requirements for Food \u0026 Food Products\",\"feedback\":null,\"optical_publish-rjcg9p\":null,\"publish_ready\":false,\"table_text\":false,\"show_for_page_layout\":false,\"wrapper_css_class\":null,\"exclude_from_search_index\":false}}]}},{\"id\":749,\"Sfacorp_TabSection_id\":467,\"collection\":\"Sfacorp_TabItem\",\"sort\":6,\"item\":{\"id\":749,\"status\":\"published\",\"sort\":null,\"user_created\":\"211f17e7-d30c-4260-909a-156da2993df4\",\"date_created\":\"2026-10-11T18:01:45.789Z\",\"user_updated\":null,\"date_updated\":null,\"content\":[{\"id\":4333,\"Sfacorp_TabItem_id\":749,\"collection\":\"Sfacorp_InPageTabTitle\",\"sort\":1,\"item\":{\"id\":749,\"status\":\"published\",\"sort\":null,\"user_created\":\"211f17e7-d30c-4260-909a-156da2993df4\",\"date_created\":\"2026-10-11T18:01:45.790Z\",\"user_updated\":null,\"date_updated\":null,\"tab_title\":\"Insects \u0026 Insect Products\"}},{\"id\":4334,\"Sfacorp_TabItem_id\":749,\"collection\":\"Sfacorp_ContentBlock\",\"sort\":2,\"item\":{\"id\":12253,\"status\":\"published\",\"sort\":null,\"user_created\":\"211f17e7-d30c-4260-909a-156da2993df4\",\"date_created\":\"2026-10-11T18:01:45.795Z\",\"user_updated\":null,\"date_updated\":null,\"body\":\"$80\",\"title\":\"Import Requirements for Food \u0026 Food Products\",\"feedback\":null,\"optical_publish-rjcg9p\":null,\"publish_ready\":false,\"table_text\":false,\"show_for_page_layout\":false,\"wrapper_css_class\":null,\"exclude_from_search_index\":false}},{\"id\":4335,\"Sfacorp_TabItem_id\":749,\"collection\":\"Sfacorp_AccordionLayout\",\"sort\":3,\"item\":{\"id\":1362,\"sort\":null,\"user_created\":\"211f17e7-d30c-4260-909a-156da2993df4\",\"date_created\":\"2026-10-11T18:01:45.804Z\",\"user_updated\":null,\"date_updated\":null,\"title\":null,\"accordion_item\":\"$3c:props:children:2:props:data:accordion_item\",\"accordion_items\":\"$3c:props:children:2:props:data:accordion_items\",\"accordion_sub_header\":\"$3c:props:children:2:props:data:accordion_sub_header\"}},{\"id\":4336,\"Sfacorp_TabItem_id\":749,\"collection\":\"Sfacorp_ContentBlock\",\"sort\":4,\"item\":{\"id\":12254,\"status\":\"published\",\"sort\":null,\"user_created\":\"211f17e7-d30c-4260-909a-156da2993df4\",\"date_created\":\"2026-10-11T18:01:45.825Z\",\"user_updated\":null,\"date_updated\":null,\"body\":\"\u003chtml\u003e\u003chead\u003e\u003c/head\u003e\u003cbody\u003e\u003cp\u003eHS and product codes for insect and insect products for human consumption can be found in\u0026nbsp;\u003ca target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"/api/assets/851f64db-b1da-4b12-8230-78147b174de1\\\" aria-label=\\\"Product Codes for Processed Food and Food Appliances\\\"\u003eProduct Codes for Processed Food\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe overseas insect processing establishment, from which the insect and insect products (for human consumption) are sourced, should be registered with SFA with submission of supporting documents such as regulated source documents and Food Safety Management System/Hazard Analysis Critical Control Points. This is a one-time registration. Please register by filling in the \u003ca href=\\\"https://form.gov.sg/643e348c3b2d45001190d449\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" data-sf-ec-immutable=\\\"\\\"\u003eonline form\u003c/a\u003e.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/body\u003e\u003c/html\u003e\",\"title\":\"Import Requirements for Food \u0026 Food Products\",\"feedback\":null,\"optical_publish-rjcg9p\":null,\"publish_ready\":false,\"table_text\":false,\"show_for_page_layout\":false,\"wrapper_css_class\":null,\"exclude_from_search_index\":false}},{\"id\":4337,\"Sfacorp_TabItem_id\":749,\"collection\":\"Sfacorp_CalloutsBlock\",\"sort\":5,\"item\":{\"id\":1447,\"status\":\"published\",\"sort\":null,\"user_created\":\"211f17e7-d30c-4260-909a-156da2993df4\",\"date_created\":\"2026-10-11T18:01:45.832Z\",\"user_updated\":null,\"date_updated\":null,\"callouts_title\":\"\",\"tooltip_is_enable\":false,\"tooltip_content\":\"\",\"callouts_content\":\"\u003chtml\u003e\u003chead\u003e\u003c/head\u003e\u003cbody\u003eIn order to facilitate import clearance, importers of insects and insect products (for human consumption and as animal feed for food-producing animals) should, in applying for permits use, the correct HS and product codes, attach the required health certificate, and declare the specific establishment code of the insect processing establishment in the appropriate fields in TradeNet. The establishment codes are to be filled in the field name, “CA/SC Code 1”. If the establishment codes are not filled in the designated field, invalid establishment codes are filled, or the required health certificate is not attached, the permit declaration will be rejected.\u003c/body\u003e\u003c/html\u003e\",\"callouts_type\":\"ToNote\",\"feedback\":null}}]}},{\"id\":750,\"Sfacorp_TabSection_id\":467,\"collection\":\"Sfacorp_TabItem\",\"sort\":7,\"item\":{\"id\":750,\"status\":\"published\",\"sort\":null,\"user_created\":\"211f17e7-d30c-4260-909a-156da2993df4\",\"date_created\":\"2026-10-11T18:01:45.845Z\",\"user_updated\":null,\"date_updated\":null,\"content\":[{\"id\":4338,\"Sfacorp_TabItem_id\":750,\"collection\":\"Sfacorp_InPageTabTitle\",\"sort\":1,\"item\":{\"id\":750,\"status\":\"published\",\"sort\":null,\"user_created\":\"211f17e7-d30c-4260-909a-156da2993df4\",\"date_created\":\"2026-10-11T18:01:45.847Z\",\"user_updated\":null,\"date_updated\":null,\"tab_title\":\"Rice\"}},{\"id\":4339,\"Sfacorp_TabItem_id\":750,\"collection\":\"Sfacorp_ContentBlock\",\"sort\":2,\"item\":{\"id\":