,\"should_open_in_new_window\":false,\"additional_urls\":[{\"url\":\"/food-import-export/licensing-registration-of-traders\"},{\"url\":\"/food-information/novel-food/licensing-registration-of-traders\"}],\"format_publish_date\":\"Published At: Oct 28th, 2026 17:06\",\"override_default_template_blocks\":false,\"date_published_at\":null,\"time_published_at\":\"00:00:00\",\"countries_and_regions\":[],\"circular_status\":[],\"blocks\":[\"915e8a02-127d-4d00-856f-c795d875a370\",\"ac5f7d4e-3135-4f9a-aef5-6c63db69c6ac\"],\"view_roles\":[],\"content_types\":[],\"raag_filter_subtype\":[],\"edit_roles\":[97031,97032,97033,97034,97035,97036,97037,97038,97039,97040,97041],\"topics\":[1098],\"featured_article_tagging\":[],\"profile_and_topic\":[1662,1663,1664,1665,1666],\"commodity_type\":[],\"template_block\":[6233,6234,6235],\"create_roles\":[]}}},{\"id\":8865,\"Sfacorp_Column93_id\":1497,\"collection\":\"Sfacorp_Helpfulness\",\"sort\":5,\"item\":{\"id\":595,\"sort\":null,\"user_created\":\"211f17e7-d30c-4260-909a-156da2993df4\",\"date_created\":\"2026-10-11T17:48:50.191Z\",\"user_updated\":null,\"date_updated\":null,\"open_in_new_tab\":true,\"search_page\":\"$44:props:data:search_page\"}}]}}]}]\n50:[\"$\",\"h4\",\"4289\",{\"id\":\"how-do-these-import-requirements-ensure-the-food-safety-of-eggs-egg-products\",\"className\":\"anchor-section-title\",\"data-text\":\"How do these import requirements ensure the food safety of Eggs \u0026 Egg Products?\"}]\n51:[\"$\",\"div\",\"4290\",{\"className\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"sfContentBlock sf-Long-text\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"\u003chtml\u003e\u003chead\u003e\u003c/head\u003e\u003cbody\u003e\u003ch2\u003eHow do these import requirements ensure the food safety of Eggs \u0026amp; Egg Products?\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eSFA adopts a science and risk-based approach to ensure that food is safe for consumption in Singapore. The requirements imposed ensure food safety and reduce the risk of foodborne illnesses.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThere is a risk of bacteria, known as \u003ci\u003eSalmonella \u003c/i\u003eEnteritidis, in fresh eggs. To address the risks, SFA requires all eggs to be imported from approved sources. Approved sources have gone through an accreditation process. One of the accreditation criteria is that farms must be free from \u003ci\u003eSalmonella \u003c/i\u003eEnteritidis.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eIn addition, every consignment must be accompanied by a veterinary health certificate. Together with other measures (e.g. inspections carried out by SFA on imports), the import requirements make it safer for us to consume eggs and egg products.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/body\u003e\u003c/html\u003e\"},\"data-directus\":\"$undefined\",\"suppressHydrationWarning\":true}]}]\n56:[\"$\",\"h4\",\"4300\",{\"id\":\"how-do-these-import-requirements-ensure-the-food-safety-for-fish-fish-products\",\"className\":\"anchor-section-title\",\"data-text\":\"How do these import requirements ensure the food safety for Fish \u0026 Fish Products?\"}]\n83:T40c,\u003chtml\u003e\u003chead\u003e\u003c/head\u003e\u003cbody\u003e\u003ch2\u003eHow do these import requirements ensure the food safety of Fish \u0026amp; Fish Products?\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eSFA adopts a science and risk-based approach to ensure that food is safe for consumption in Singapore. The requirements imposed ensure food safety and reduce the risk of foodborne illnesses.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cp\u003eMore requirements are imposed on high-risk Fish \u0026amp; Fish Products.\u0026nbsp;For example, frozen oysters require health certificates as they are more susceptible to microbiological and chemical contamination.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eIf you intend to import live oysters, you will need to obtain a health certificate as well as from countries/regions that meet SFA’s requirements for a shellfish sanitation programme. This is because live oysters pose a higher risk than frozen ones.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe labelling requirements also provide consumers with the information to make informed choices. It also improves traceability in the event of food safety issues or recalls.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/body\u003e\u003c/html\u003e57:[\"$\",\"div\",\"4301\",{\"className\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"sfContentBlock sf-Long-text\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$83\"},\"data-directus\":\"$undefined\",\"suppressHydrationWarning\":true}]}]\n58:[\"$\",\"h4\",\"4310\",{\"id\":\"how-do-i-comply-with-the-import-requirements-for-fresh-fruits-vegetables\",\"className\":\"anchor-section-title\",\"data-text\":\"How do I comply with the import requirements for Fresh Fruits \u0026 Vegetables?\"}]\n59:[\"$\",\"div\",\"4311\",{\"className\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"sfContentBlock sf-Long-text\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"\u003chtml\u003e\u003chead\u003e\u003c/head\u003e\u003cbody\u003e\u003ch2\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003ch2\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003ch2\u003eHow do I comply with the import requirements for Fresh Fruits \u0026amp; Vegetables?\u003c/h2\u003e\u003c/body\u003e\u003c/html\u003e\"},\"data-directus\":\"$undefined\",\"suppressHydrationWarning\":true}]}]\n5a:[\"$\",\"$L49\",\"4312\",{\"data\":{\"id\":1359,\"sort\":null,\"user_created\":\"211f17e7-d30c-4260-909a-156da2993df4\",\"date_created\":\"2026-10-11T18:01:45.601Z\",\"user_updated\":null,\"date_updated\":null,\"title\":null,\"accordion_item\":\"$2b:props:sections:1:item:left_area:0:item:items:3:item:content:10:item:accordion_item\",\"accordion_items\":\"$2b:props:sections:1:item:left_area:0:item:items:3:item:content:10:item:accordion_items\",\"accordion_sub_header\":\"$2b:props:sections:1:item:left_area:0:item:items:3:item:content:10:item:accordion_sub_header\"},\"blockId\":\"4312\",\"itemId\":1359,\"pageId\":\"$undefined\",\"detailData\":\"$undefined\",\"lastUpdated\":\"$undefined\",\"pageTitle\":\"$undefined\",\"current_permalink\":\"$undefined\"}]\n5b:[\"$\",\"h4\",\"4313\",{\"id\":\"how-do-these-import-requirements-ensure-the-food-safety-of-fresh-fruits-vegetables\",\"className\":\"anchor-section-title\",\"data-text\":\"How do these import requirements ensure the food safety of Fresh Fruits \u0026 Vegetables?\"}]\n5c:[\"$\",\"div\",\"4314\",{\"className\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"sfContentBlock sf-Long-text\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"\u003chtml\u003e\u003chead\u003e\u003c/head\u003e\u003cbody\u003e\u003ch2\u003eHow do these import requirements ensure the food safety of Fresh Fruits \u0026amp; Vegetables?\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eSFA adopts a science and risk-based approach to ensure that food is safe for consumption in Singapore. The requirements imposed ensure food safety and reduce the risk of foodborne illnesses.\u0026nbsp;These requirements ensure that imported fresh fruits and vegetables are safe for consumption.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFor instance, the requirement to check the pesticides used and to ensure that it does not exceed the prevailing limits ensures that the imported consignments do not contain any prohibited pesticides which may be harmful when consumed.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe labelling requirements also provide consumers with the information to make informed choices. It also improves traceability in the event of food safety issues or recalls.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/body\u003e\u003c/html\u003e\"},\"data-directus\":\"$undefined\",\"suppressHydrationWarning\":true}]}]\n5f:[\"$\",\"h4\",\"4321\",{\"id\":\"enhanced-regulated-source-programme-imports-from-malaysia\",\"className\":\"anchor-section-title\",\"data-text\":\"Enhanced Regulated Source Programme (imports from Malaysia)\"}]\n84:Ta47,\u003chtml\u003e\u003chead\u003e\u003c/head\u003e\u003cbody\u003e\u003ch2\u003e\u003cb style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: inherit; font-size: var(--font-size-h4); text-align: inherit; text-transform: inherit; word-spacing: normal; caret-color: auto; white-space: inherit\"\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003ci\u003eEnhanced Regulated Source Programme\u003c/i\u003e (imports from Malaysia)\u003c/h2\u003e\u003ch2\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eIn addition to the supporting documents required for specific food products listed above, the \u003ci\u003eEnhanced Regulated Source Programme \u003c/i\u003erequires processed food imported \u003cb\u003efrom Malaysia\u003c/b\u003e to come from registered establishments.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe following food products are covered under the programme. You are required to submit documents showing that your food products are obtained from registered establishments.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"table-wrap\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"table-wrap-scroll\"\u003e\u003ctable style=\"width: 844px\"\u003e\u003ctbody\u003e\u003ctr style=\"height: 16.6666666666667%\"\u003e\u003cth style=\"width: 6.46501%\" data-role=\"resizable\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eNo.\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/th\u003e\u003cth style=\"width: 93%\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eTypes of Products\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/th\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr style=\"height: 16.6666666666667%\"\u003e\u003ctd style=\"width: 6.46501%\"\u003e1\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd style=\"width: 93.535%\"\u003e\u003cp\u003eInfant formula\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"callout-type\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"to-note\"\u003e\u003cp\u003eYou can use the  \u003ca target=\"_blank\" href=\"/api/assets/a696d541-6cf9-49b3-80d0-eb06095f0b22\" aria-label=\"Calculation Guide for Infant Formula (Excel sheet)\"\u003eCalculation guide for infant formula\u003c/a\u003e to ensure the nutritional composition is within the limits. \u003c/p\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr style=\"height: 16.6666666666667%\"\u003e\u003ctd style=\"width: 6.46501%\"\u003e2\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd style=\"width: 93.535%\"\u003eInfant Cereal\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr style=\"height: 16.6666666666667%\"\u003e\u003ctd style=\"width: 6.46501%\"\u003e3\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003e\u003cp\u003eTraditional cakes/kueh kueh, cooked rice products, and other perishable cooked food that are ready-to-eat.\u0026nbsp;Frozen and/or uncooked products are currently excluded. \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFor more information, see\u0026nbsp;\u003ca target=\"_blank\" href=\"/api/assets/87e4aaf6-bb09-4586-b032-58632955bab0\" aria-label=\"Examples of Traditional Cakes (Kueh Kueh), Cooked Rice Products and Other Perishable Cooked Food\"\u003eExamples of Traditional Cakes (Kueh Kueh), Cooked Rice Products and Other Perishable Cooked Food\u003c/a\u003e.\u2028\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr style=\"height: 16.6666666666667%\"\u003e\u003ctd style=\"width: 6.46501%\"\u003e4\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd style=\"width: 93.535%\"\u003eMooncakes\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr style=\"height: 16.6666666666667%\"\u003e\u003ctd style=\"width: 6.46501%\"\u003e5\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd style=\"width: 93.535%\"\u003eDried beancurd sticks, skin, and sheets\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr style=\"height: 16.6666666666667%\"\u003e\u003ctd style=\"width: 6.46501%\"\u003e6\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd style=\"width: 93.535%\"\u003eEdible oil\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/tbody\u003e\u003c/table\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/body\u003e\u003c/html\u003e60:[\"$\",\"div\",\"4322\",{\"className\":\"table-text sf_colsIn Kzw13q_tableText\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"sfContentBlock sf-Long-text\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$84\"},\"data-directus\":\"$undefined\",\"suppressHydrationWarning\":true}]}]\n61:[\"$\",\"h4\",\"4323\",{\"id\":\"how-and-what-do-i-need-to-submit-to-prove-that-processed-food-products-under-the-enhanced-regulated-source-programme-are-from-registered-establishment\",\"className\":\"anchor-section-title\",\"data-text\":\"How and what do I need to submit to prove that processed food products under the Enhanced Regulated Source Programme are from registered establishment?\"}]\n62:[\"$\",\"div\",\"4324\",{\"className\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"sfContentBlock sf-Long-text\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"\u003chtml\u003e\u003chead\u003e\u003c/head\u003e\u003cbody\u003e\u003ch2\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003ch2\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003ch2 id=\\\"ready-to-eat\\\"\u003eHow and what do I need to\u003cb\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/b\u003esubmit to prove that processed food products under the \u003ci\u003eEnhanced \u003c/i\u003e\u003ci\u003eRegulated Source Programme\u003c/i\u003e are from registered establishment?\u003c/h2\u003e\u003c/body\u003e\u003c/html\u003e\"},\"data-directus\":\"$undefined\",\"suppressHydrationWarning\":true}]}]\n63:[\"$\",\"$L49\",\"4325\",{\"data\":{\"id\":1360,\"sort\":null,\"user_created\":\"211f17e7-d30c-4260-909a-156da2993df4\",\"date_created\":\"2026-10-11T18:01:45.699Z\",\"user_updated\":null,\"date_updated\":null,\"title\":null,\"accordion_item\":\"$2b:props:sections:1:item:left_area:0:item:items:4:item:content:10:item:accordion_item\",\"accordion_items\":\"$2b:props:sections:1:item:left_area:0:item:items:4:item:content:10:item:accordion_items\",\"accordion_sub_header\":\"$2b:props:sections:1:item:left_area:0:item:items:4:item:content:10:item:accordion_sub_header\"},\"blockId\":\"4325\",\"itemId\":1360,\"pageId\":\"$undefined\",\"detailData\":\"$undefined\",\"lastUpdated\":\"$undefined\",\"pageTitle\":\"$undefined\",\"current_permalink\":\"$undefined\"}]\n64:[\"$\",\"h4\",\"4326\",{\"id\":\"ready-to-eat-minimally-processed-mp-cut-peeled-fruits-including-coconuts-vegetables-and-cut-sugarcane-from-malaysia\",\"className\":\"anchor-section-title\",\"data-text\":\"Ready-to-Eat Minimally Processed (MP) Cut/ Peeled Fruits (including coconuts), Vegetables and Cut Sugarcane from Malaysia\"}]\n85:T4cb,\u003chtml\u003e\u003chead\u003e\u003c/head\u003e\u003cbody\u003e\u003ch2\u003e\u003cb style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: inherit; font-size: var(--font-size-h4); text-align: inherit; text-transform: inherit; word-spacing: normal; caret-color: auto; white-space: inherit\"\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003ci\u003e\u003c/i\u003eReady-to-Eat Minimally Processed (MP) Cut/ Peeled Fruits (including coconuts), Vegetables and Cut Sugarcane from Malaysia\u003c/h2\u003e\u003ch2\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eTo import \u003cb\u003eReady-to-Eat\u003c/b\u003e minimally processed cut/peeled fruits (including coconuts), vegetables and cut sugarcane from Malaysia, you are required to submit documents showing that it is obtained from producers registered and certified by Malaysian Ministry of Health.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe registration process is the same as the \u003ci style=\"background-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; text-transform: inherit; word-spacing: normal; caret-color: auto; white-space: inherit\"\u003eEnhanced Regulated Source Programme\u003c/i\u003e. Please refer to the \u003ca href=\"#ready-to-eat\" data-sf-ec-immutable=\"\"\u003eabove section\u003c/a\u003e \u003ci style=\"background-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; text-transform: inherit; word-spacing: normal; caret-color: auto; white-space: inherit\"\u003e\u003c/i\u003efor information.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/body\u003e\u003c/html\u003e65:[\"$\",\"div\",\"4327\",{\"className\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"sfContentBlock sf-Long-text\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$85\"},\"data-directus\":\"$undefined\",\"suppressHydrationWarning\":true}]}]\n66:[\"$\",\"h4\",\"4328\",{\"id\":\"supplier-registration-for-infant-cereal-products-voluntary-scheme\",\"className\":\"anchor-section-title\",\"data-text\":\"Supplier Registration for Infant Cereal Products (Voluntary Scheme)\"}]\n67:[\"$\",\"div\",\"4329\",{\"className\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"sfContentBlock sf-Long-text\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"\u003chtml\u003e\u003chead\u003e\u003c/head\u003e\u003cbody\u003e\u003ch2\u003eSupplier Registration for Infant Cereal Products (Voluntary Scheme)\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eUnder the Supplier Registration for Infant Cereal Products Voluntary Scheme, importers are exempted from the submission of laboratory reports of Aflatoxin B1 testing for every consignment.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eOnly manufacturers with existing food safety management and assurance programmes, which ensure that their food or food products comply with Singapore’s food safety standards and laws, will be registered.\u003c/p\u003eYou may register your supplier of infant cereal products under this scheme by following the steps below:\u0026nbsp;\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/body\u003e\u003c/html\u003e\"},\"data-directus\":\"$undefined\",\"suppressHydrationWarning\":true}]}]\n68:[\"$\",\"$L49\",\"4330\",{\"data\":{\"id\":1361,\"sort\":null,\"user_created\":\"211f17e7-d30c-4260-909a-156da2993df4\",\"date_created\":\"2026-10-11T18:01:45.737Z\",\"user_updated\":null,\"date_updated\":null,\"title\":null,\"accordion_item\":\"$2b:props:sections:1:item:left_area:0:item:items:4:item:content:15:item:accordion_item\",\"accordion_items\":\"$2b:props:sections:1:item:left_area:0:item:items:4:item:content:15:item:accordion_items\",\"accordion_sub_header\":\"$2b:props:sections:1:item:left_area:0:item:items:4:item:content:15:item:accordion_sub_header\"},\"blockId\":\"4330\",\"itemId\":1361,\"pageId\":\"$undefined\",\"detailData\":\"$undefined\",\"lastUpdated\":\"$undefined\",\"pageTitle\":\"$undefined\",\"current_permalink\":\"$undefined\"}]\n69:[\"$\",\"h4\",\"4331\",{\"id\":\"how-do-we-ensure-the-food-safety-of-imported-processed-food-food-contact-articles\",\"className\":\"anchor-section-title\",\"data-text\":\"How do we ensure the food safety of imported Processed Food \u0026 Food Contact Articles?\"}]\n6a:[\"$\",\"div\",\"4332\",{\"className\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"sfContentBlock sf-Long-text\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"\u003chtml\u003e\u003chead\u003e\u003c/head\u003e\u003cbody\u003e\u003ch2\u003eHow do we ensure the food safety of imported Processed Food \u0026amp; Food Contact Articles?\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eSFA adopts a science and risk-based approach to ensure that food is safe for consumption in Singapore.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eSFA samples imported food for regulatory testing, with a focus on food that are of higher food safety risks.\u0026nbsp;Food that does not meet our regulatory requirements will not be allowed for import or sale in Singapore.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/body\u003e\u003c/html\u003e\"},\"data-directus\":\"$undefined\",\"suppressHydrationWarning\":true}]}]\n70:[\"$\",\"div\",\"4336\",{\"className\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"sfContentBlock sf-Long-text\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"\u003chtml\u003e\u003chead\u003e\u003c/head\u003e\u003cbody\u003e\u003cp\u003eHS and product codes for insect and insect products for human consumption can be found in\u0026nbsp;\u003ca target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"/api/assets/851f64db-b1da-4b12-8230-78147b174de1\\\" aria-label=\\\"Product Codes for Processed Food and Food Appliances\\\"\u003eProduct Codes for Processed Food\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe overseas insect processing establishment, from which the insect and insect products (for human consumption) are sourced, should be registered with SFA with submission of supporting documents such as regulated source documents and Food Safety Management System/Hazard Analysis Critical Control Points. This is a one-time registration. Please register by filling in the \u003ca href=\\\"https://form.gov.sg/643e348c3b2d45001190d449\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" data-sf-ec-immutable=\\\"\\\"\u003eonline form\u003c/a\u003e.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/body\u003e\u003c/html\u003e\"},\"data-directus\":\"$undefined\",\"suppressHydrationWarning\":true}]}]\n71:[\"$\",\"$L29\",\"4337\",{\"data\":{\"id\":1447,\"status\":\"published\",\"sort\":null,\"user_created\":\"211f17e7-d30c-4260-909a-156da2993df4\",\"date_created\":\"2026-10-11T18:01:45.832Z\",\"user_updated\":null,\"date_updated\":null,\"callouts_title\":\"\",\"tooltip_is_enable\":false,\"tooltip_content\":\"\",\"callouts_content\":\"\u003chtml\u003e\u003chead\u003e\u003c/head\u003e\u003cbody\u003eIn order to facilitate import clearance, importers of insects and insect products (for human consumption and as animal feed for food-producing animals) should, in applying for permits use, the correct HS and product codes, attach the required health certificate, and declare the specific establishment code of the insect processing establishment in the appropriate fields in TradeNet. The establishment codes are to be filled in the field name, “CA/SC Code 1”. If the establishment codes are not filled in the designated field, invalid establishment codes are filled, or the required health certificate is not attached, the permit declaration will be rejected.\u003c/body\u003e\u003c/html\u003e\",\"callouts_type\":\"ToNote\",\"feedback\":null},\"blockId\":\"4337\",\"itemId\":1447,\"pageId\":\"$undefined\",\"detailData\":\"$undefined\",\"lastUpdated\":\"$undefined\",\"pageTitle\":\"$undefined\",\"current_permalink\":\"$undefined\"}]\n86:I[97711,[\"$4\",\"$1d\",\"$1e\",\"$1f\"],\"default\"]\n87:I[78943,[\"$4\",\"$1d\",\"$1e\",\"$1f\"],\"\"]\n75:[\"$\",\"$L86\",\"1265-0\",{\"data\":{\